WEBVTT

1
00:01:00,727 --> 00:01:01,561
TERVERIFIKASI

2
00:01:29,214 --> 00:01:33,760
Sampai pukul 14.00,
sudah ada lebih dari 87.000.

3
00:01:33,843 --> 00:01:35,595
Ada 87.000 obrolan grup?

4
00:01:35,678 --> 00:01:38,306
- Dua kali lipat dari kemarin?
- Ini malam Sabtu.

5
00:01:39,474 --> 00:01:43,144
Sudah kuduga, istriku memang luar biasa.
Sangat menakjubkan!

6
00:01:43,228 --> 00:01:45,063
Semua ini hasil kerja sistem.

7
00:01:45,146 --> 00:01:47,774
<i>Kecerdasan buatan membuat ribuan grup</i>

8
00:01:47,857 --> 00:01:49,526
<i>dan pesanannya membeludak.</i>

9
00:01:49,609 --> 00:01:52,612
Dulu hanya ada 100 transaksi sehari.

10
00:01:52,695 --> 00:01:54,072
Sekarang, ada 100.000.

11
00:01:54,739 --> 00:01:57,909
Jika dikalikan 12.000 won,
artinya 1,2 miliar sehari!

12
00:02:22,976 --> 00:02:24,435
Oke.

13
00:02:24,519 --> 00:02:27,147
- Sudah selesai dikirim?
- Astaga. Sialan.

14
00:02:27,772 --> 00:02:29,774
- Siapa kau?
- Siapa lagi?

15
00:02:30,275 --> 00:02:33,069
- Aku detektif. Sini tanganmu.
- Aku sibuk.

16
00:02:34,821 --> 00:02:36,322
Bajingan ini…

17
00:02:40,910 --> 00:02:42,495
- Tanganmu.
- Polisi Bangsat!

18
00:02:43,204 --> 00:02:45,123
- Sini tanganmu. Bagus.
- Sakit!

19
00:02:45,206 --> 00:02:47,208
Jangan bawa barang berbahaya.

20
00:02:48,042 --> 00:02:48,877
Kabur?

21
00:02:49,794 --> 00:02:51,462
Dasar berandal. Diam saja.

22
00:02:52,547 --> 00:02:54,924
Kau tak akan kupukul jika menurut.

23
00:02:57,552 --> 00:02:59,387
- Keren sekali!
- Hebat!

24
00:03:07,645 --> 00:03:09,689
- Selamat sudah bebas, Bos.
- Selamat, Bos.

25
00:03:12,984 --> 00:03:14,277
Mana Jae-chun?

26
00:03:14,360 --> 00:03:16,905
Kak Jae-chun masih di Tiongkok.

27
00:03:16,988 --> 00:03:19,532
Hanya kami bertiga yang tersisa.

28
00:03:22,410 --> 00:03:24,078
Selama aku tak ada,

29
00:03:24,579 --> 00:03:27,332
kudengar bajingan bernama Ma Do-jun
mengambil alih Incheon.

30
00:03:27,415 --> 00:03:29,000
Bukan hanya Incheon, Bos.

31
00:03:29,083 --> 00:03:30,585
Dia mengendalikan seluruh negeri.

32
00:03:30,668 --> 00:03:32,128
Ada narkotika baru,

33
00:03:32,212 --> 00:03:35,089
jadi dia mengeruk semua uang
di penjuru negeri.

34
00:03:35,173 --> 00:03:37,759
Aku harus beri salam untuk mengenalnya.

35
00:03:39,219 --> 00:03:41,012
Dengan sopan.

36
00:03:47,310 --> 00:03:48,144
Siapa?

37
00:03:48,228 --> 00:03:49,812
Yong-gang dari Incheon.

38
00:03:49,896 --> 00:03:51,564
Katanya kau pasti tahu, Bos.

39
00:03:52,065 --> 00:03:53,524
Yong-gang dari Incheon?

40
00:03:53,608 --> 00:03:56,027
Dia ingin memberi salam dengan sopan.

41
00:04:00,615 --> 00:04:01,741
Dia siapa?

42
00:04:13,044 --> 00:04:14,337
Ini Sektor Dua.

43
00:04:14,879 --> 00:04:17,590
Ma Do-jun sudah pergi.
Masuk dan cek barangnya.

44
00:04:28,476 --> 00:04:29,352
Apa?

45
00:04:31,354 --> 00:04:32,689
Dia bilang apa?

46
00:04:38,569 --> 00:04:39,946
Dia bilang apa?

47
00:04:41,489 --> 00:04:42,657
"Dia siapa?"

48
00:04:46,286 --> 00:04:48,871
Yong-gang dari Incheon
mengajaknya bertemu,

49
00:04:50,039 --> 00:04:51,541
tapi dia bilang apa?

50
00:04:52,583 --> 00:04:53,751
"Dia siapa?"

51
00:04:55,086 --> 00:04:56,337
Astaga!

52
00:04:57,171 --> 00:04:58,756
"Dia siapa"?

53
00:05:02,010 --> 00:05:04,387
"Dia siapa"?

54
00:05:12,061 --> 00:05:13,146
Kau yakin

55
00:05:14,480 --> 00:05:16,149
ini tempat jaringan narkoba?

56
00:05:16,232 --> 00:05:17,358
Aku sangat yakin.

57
00:05:17,859 --> 00:05:19,277
Ini markas mereka.

58
00:05:24,240 --> 00:05:25,116
Tempat ini

59
00:05:25,616 --> 00:05:26,743
Songdo, 'kan?

60
00:05:26,826 --> 00:05:28,286
Daerah ini direvitalisasi.

61
00:05:30,955 --> 00:05:31,789
Bos.

62
00:05:36,961 --> 00:05:38,421
Bawalah untuk jaga-jaga.

63
00:05:44,093 --> 00:05:45,595
Aku adalah Yong-gang.

64
00:05:46,095 --> 00:05:47,263
Aku Yong-gang.

65
00:06:10,203 --> 00:06:11,829
Aku mau bertemu Ma Do-jun.

66
00:06:12,747 --> 00:06:15,083
Bisa tolong diulangi, Pak?

67
00:06:23,549 --> 00:06:26,761
Aku datang ingin bertemu Pak Ma Do-jun.

68
00:06:26,844 --> 00:06:28,262
- Atas nama siapa?
- Apa?

69
00:06:28,763 --> 00:06:30,348
Sebutkan namamu.

70
00:06:30,431 --> 00:06:31,974
Kim Yong-gang.

71
00:06:32,058 --> 00:06:33,935
Pak Kim Yeong-gwang?

72
00:06:34,018 --> 00:06:34,852
Bukan.

73
00:06:34,936 --> 00:06:37,480
Bukan Yeong-gwang, tapi Yong-gang.

74
00:06:37,563 --> 00:06:40,191
Baiklah. "Yong" seperti doyong.

75
00:06:40,274 --> 00:06:42,318
- "Gang" seperti renggang.
- Apa?

76
00:06:42,402 --> 00:06:44,821
Kim Yong-gang. Benar?

77
00:06:46,989 --> 00:06:47,907
Ya.

78
00:06:48,449 --> 00:06:49,575
Sudah terdata.

79
00:06:49,659 --> 00:06:52,703
Pak Ma sedang rapat,
jadi mohon tunggu sebentar.

80
00:06:54,247 --> 00:06:55,289
Baiklah.

81
00:07:01,462 --> 00:07:04,090
Selama aku tak ada, aku penasaran

82
00:07:04,173 --> 00:07:06,551
siapa orang yang mengambil alih Incheon.

83
00:07:07,051 --> 00:07:09,512
Apa kau tahu siapa aku?

84
00:07:09,595 --> 00:07:11,222
Kau Kim Yeong-gwang, 'kan?

85
00:07:11,806 --> 00:07:14,225
Bukan Yeong-gwang, tapi Yong-gang.

86
00:07:14,308 --> 00:07:16,310
Namaku adalah Kim Yong-gang.

87
00:07:16,394 --> 00:07:18,688
Wajar jika aku salah.
Baiklah, Kim Yeong-gwang.

88
00:07:18,771 --> 00:07:20,231
Salah lagi!

89
00:07:20,815 --> 00:07:23,151
Pak Yong-gang. Benar?

90
00:07:26,279 --> 00:07:28,156
Incheon itu daerah kekuasaanku.

91
00:07:28,656 --> 00:07:30,616
Selama aku di penjara,

92
00:07:30,700 --> 00:07:33,953
kau cuma menangani daerahku sementara.

93
00:07:34,036 --> 00:07:37,415
Aku tak berniat merebut
jaringan kalian begitu saja.

94
00:07:37,498 --> 00:07:39,876
Jika pengalamanku dan keahlianku

95
00:07:39,959 --> 00:07:41,502
digabung dengan caramu berbisnis,

96
00:07:42,003 --> 00:07:45,381
bukan cuma Incheon,
kita bisa menguasai seluruh negeri.

97
00:07:45,465 --> 00:07:46,382
Maka dari itu,

98
00:07:47,592 --> 00:07:48,968
mari jalankan ini bersama.

99
00:07:54,390 --> 00:07:55,433
Berani kau?

100
00:07:55,516 --> 00:07:56,559
Dia kenapa?

101
00:07:57,727 --> 00:07:59,353
Kau lihat apa?

102
00:08:00,855 --> 00:08:02,565
- Sial.
- Tahan, Kak!

103
00:08:10,615 --> 00:08:11,574
Kau tertawa?

104
00:08:12,366 --> 00:08:14,076
Yang benar saja.

105
00:08:15,495 --> 00:08:16,329
Pak.

106
00:08:16,412 --> 00:08:20,500
Sudah keluar penjara, mulailah hidup baru.
Kenapa kau masih begini?

107
00:08:20,583 --> 00:08:21,417
Kau memukulku?

108
00:08:21,501 --> 00:08:24,712
Berhenti menonton film.
Astaga, itu film zaman kapan?

109
00:08:26,130 --> 00:08:27,632
Siapkan rapat berikutnya.

110
00:08:27,715 --> 00:08:28,883
Rapat berikutnya?

111
00:08:31,344 --> 00:08:34,013
- Mulai hidup baru. Semangat, Yeong-gwang!
- Kau…

112
00:08:34,096 --> 00:08:36,015
- Yeong-gwang lagi?
- Senang berjumpa!

113
00:08:36,098 --> 00:08:37,850
- Semangat!
- Kau salah lagi…

114
00:08:38,351 --> 00:08:39,769
- Pasti sengaja…
- Ayo, Pak.

115
00:08:39,852 --> 00:08:41,187
Aku ini…

116
00:08:57,620 --> 00:08:58,913
Pak Hwang!

117
00:09:00,206 --> 00:09:01,707
Ini barang buktinya.

118
00:09:03,042 --> 00:09:04,293
- Tangkap semuanya!
- Siap!

119
00:09:07,463 --> 00:09:08,881
Berengsek mereka semua.

120
00:09:08,965 --> 00:09:10,633
Hei, halau mereka!

121
00:09:11,551 --> 00:09:12,552
Tangkap!

122
00:09:16,681 --> 00:09:17,807
Jangan bergerak!

123
00:09:18,724 --> 00:09:19,725
Sial!

124
00:09:23,271 --> 00:09:25,565
Detektif Lee, minta borgol. Diam!

125
00:09:26,190 --> 00:09:27,984
- Pegang yang erat.
- Ini tak akan lama.

126
00:09:37,535 --> 00:09:39,120
Tiga ekor lagi.

127
00:09:42,873 --> 00:09:44,125
Bandar bajingan!

128
00:09:45,585 --> 00:09:47,128
Dasar sinting!

129
00:10:01,225 --> 00:10:02,685
Hei!

130
00:10:06,981 --> 00:10:08,441
Kemari kau.

131
00:10:13,404 --> 00:10:15,114
Hei, kau baik-baik saja?

132
00:10:21,996 --> 00:10:22,872
Ma Do-jun.

133
00:10:28,336 --> 00:10:29,545
Tunggu sebentar.

134
00:10:30,671 --> 00:10:31,839
Tunggu dulu.

135
00:10:35,968 --> 00:10:37,303
Sisa satu untukmu.

136
00:10:38,512 --> 00:10:40,389
- Benar untukku?
- Tentu saja.

137
00:10:41,515 --> 00:10:42,975
Kalau begitu, aku pakai ini.

138
00:10:52,568 --> 00:10:53,819
Bajingan!

139
00:11:06,082 --> 00:11:07,375
Dasar berandal.

140
00:11:20,596 --> 00:11:22,890
- Kemari kau.
- Sialan!

141
00:11:23,391 --> 00:11:24,642
Tangkap dia!

142
00:11:28,771 --> 00:11:30,731
Bajingan pengecut itu…

143
00:11:31,982 --> 00:11:34,402
- Buang pisaumu.
- Tembaklah.

144
00:11:34,944 --> 00:11:36,946
Buang pisaumu. Kau sudah tamat.

145
00:11:37,029 --> 00:11:38,322
Dasar tolol.

146
00:11:53,337 --> 00:11:54,505
Sialan.

147
00:12:04,974 --> 00:12:05,850
Diam!

148
00:12:05,933 --> 00:12:07,518
Tamat riwayatmu, Bajingan.

149
00:12:14,483 --> 00:12:17,319
Ini Sektor Dua. Sektor Satu, jawab.

150
00:12:17,403 --> 00:12:18,612
<i>Ini Sektor Satu.</i>

151
00:12:18,696 --> 00:12:20,114
Ini hari kedua pengintaian.

152
00:12:21,115 --> 00:12:22,324
Target sangat sensitif.

153
00:12:22,408 --> 00:12:24,243
Jangan buat kesalahan sedikit pun.

154
00:12:25,703 --> 00:12:26,579
<i>Target muncul.</i>

155
00:12:29,665 --> 00:12:30,750
Tetap di posisi.

156
00:12:30,833 --> 00:12:31,792
<i>Kami akan masuk.</i>

157
00:12:31,876 --> 00:12:33,502
Tidak, tetap di posisimu.

158
00:12:34,211 --> 00:12:35,171
<i>Target kembali.</i>

159
00:12:38,090 --> 00:12:40,426
<i>Sudah masuk perangkap. Akhirnya masuk!</i>

160
00:12:40,509 --> 00:12:41,469
Operasi dimulai.

161
00:12:48,392 --> 00:12:50,770
- Jangan buat kaget. Tenang.
- Perlahan. Tenanglah.

162
00:12:50,853 --> 00:12:51,687
Ke sebelah sini.

163
00:12:51,771 --> 00:12:53,397
Tenanglah.

164
00:12:59,904 --> 00:13:01,906
Dari luar, ia terlihat sehat.

165
00:13:01,989 --> 00:13:04,575
Ia akan kubawa ke klinik
dan cek menyeluruh.

166
00:13:06,076 --> 00:13:08,704
Dokter, terima kasih untuk hari ini.

167
00:13:09,288 --> 00:13:10,581
Tak perlu berterima kasih.

168
00:13:11,499 --> 00:13:13,584
Ini soal menyelamatkan nyawa.

169
00:13:14,168 --> 00:13:15,711
Tentu harus saling bantu.

170
00:13:24,220 --> 00:13:27,014
- Mau pergi saja?
- Silakan jika Ibu mau pergi.

171
00:13:27,515 --> 00:13:29,016
Aku akan tetap di sini.

172
00:13:31,060 --> 00:13:33,604
Ayo pergi. Ini waktunya pergi bimbel.

173
00:13:33,687 --> 00:13:35,773
Lebih penting bimbel atau Ayah?

174
00:13:38,943 --> 00:13:39,985
Putri Ayah!

175
00:13:40,986 --> 00:13:41,821
Ayah!

176
00:13:42,655 --> 00:13:45,074
<i>Have nice day!</i>

177
00:13:46,951 --> 00:13:48,077
Hei, maaf.

178
00:13:48,160 --> 00:13:49,662
Yeon-ju, maaf Ayah telat.

179
00:13:49,745 --> 00:13:51,455
- Apa kabar?
- Minta maaf terus.

180
00:13:51,539 --> 00:13:53,999
Sudah kubilang,
aku ada konsultasi dengan klien.

181
00:13:54,500 --> 00:13:56,043
Waktumu 15 menit lagi.

182
00:13:56,126 --> 00:13:57,795
Ayolah, jangan begitu.

183
00:13:57,878 --> 00:14:00,714
Kami sudah dua minggu tak bertemu.

184
00:14:00,798 --> 00:14:01,799
Tiga puluh menit.

185
00:14:02,508 --> 00:14:03,884
Tiga puluh menit. Oke?

186
00:14:06,720 --> 00:14:07,721
Yeon-ju.

187
00:14:08,222 --> 00:14:09,890
Mau menyerukan salam kita?

188
00:14:10,808 --> 00:14:12,685
- Keadilan?
- Pasti menang!

189
00:14:12,768 --> 00:14:14,520
- Penjahat?
- Pasti tertangkap!

190
00:14:14,603 --> 00:14:15,771
- Baik…
- Dihormati.

191
00:14:15,855 --> 00:14:16,856
- Jahat…
- Dihukum.

192
00:14:16,939 --> 00:14:18,440
Hore!

193
00:14:18,524 --> 00:14:19,441
Ya!

194
00:14:20,901 --> 00:14:22,778
Pertemuan ayah dan anak yang mengharukan.

195
00:14:23,362 --> 00:14:25,197
Kalian memang kompak.

196
00:14:25,781 --> 00:14:28,409
Oke, kuberikan bonus.
Aku kembali sejam lagi.

197
00:14:28,492 --> 00:14:30,286
Hore!

198
00:14:30,786 --> 00:14:32,872
Oh, iya. <i>Dog Doctor </i>apa kabar?

199
00:14:33,622 --> 00:14:36,458
Bukan itu namanya.
Dokter Anjing. Dia apa kabar?

200
00:14:37,376 --> 00:14:40,296
Jika tak bisa bahasa Inggris,
tak usah berusaha.

201
00:14:40,796 --> 00:14:44,425
Dan bukan "<i>have nice day</i>",
tapi "<i>have a nice day</i>". Kau salah.

202
00:14:45,342 --> 00:14:46,427
Oke.

203
00:14:49,096 --> 00:14:50,890
<i>Have a nice day.</i>

204
00:14:51,432 --> 00:14:53,267
Dia tak pernah berubah.

205
00:14:53,350 --> 00:14:54,184
Baiklah!

206
00:14:55,978 --> 00:14:57,146
Ini dia!

207
00:14:57,229 --> 00:14:59,523
Yeon-ju ingin ini, 'kan? Lihatlah.

208
00:15:00,316 --> 00:15:01,817
Ini bisa panggilan video.

209
00:15:01,901 --> 00:15:04,570
Jam Tangan Nanas? Ini barang tiruan.

210
00:15:04,653 --> 00:15:05,863
Apa?

211
00:15:06,947 --> 00:15:09,992
Ayah baru sudah membelikan
jam tangan pintar asli.

212
00:15:12,953 --> 00:15:15,539
Ini akan kugunakan untuk menghubungi Ayah.

213
00:15:16,707 --> 00:15:17,750
Yeon-ju.

214
00:15:18,375 --> 00:15:20,252
Tak semua yang baru itu bagus.

215
00:15:20,336 --> 00:15:21,921
Begitu pula soal ayah.

216
00:15:22,004 --> 00:15:24,048
- Jika ayah barumu belikan barang…
- Oh, ya.

217
00:15:24,798 --> 00:15:25,799
Bagaimana?

218
00:15:26,300 --> 00:15:27,134
Ayah menangkapnya?

219
00:15:28,344 --> 00:15:30,095
Siapa ayahmu ini? Tentu saja.

220
00:15:30,679 --> 00:15:32,014
Salut.

221
00:15:32,097 --> 00:15:34,725
Ayah, tunjukkan kepadaku!

222
00:15:34,808 --> 00:15:35,643
Apa?

223
00:15:35,726 --> 00:15:37,686
Senyum itu. Senyum mematikan.

224
00:15:38,979 --> 00:15:40,105
Senyum mematikan?

225
00:15:45,945 --> 00:15:47,738
Wah, keren!

226
00:15:48,822 --> 00:15:51,825
<i>Ini operasi penangkapan</i>
<i>yang disusun polisi selama dua tahun</i>

227
00:15:51,909 --> 00:15:54,495
<i>untuk membongkar</i>
<i>jaringan narkoba sintetis.</i>

228
00:15:54,578 --> 00:15:56,789
<i>Para detektif memasuki pabrik tersebut</i>

229
00:15:56,872 --> 00:15:59,416
<i>setelah menerima sinyal</i>
<i>dari polisi yang sudah menyusup.</i>

230
00:15:59,500 --> 00:16:03,754
<i>Jaringan narkoba yang mengedarkan</i>
<i>narkoba sintetis kepada generasi muda</i>

231
00:16:03,837 --> 00:16:06,173
<i>dengan metode “lempar" berhasil ditangkap.</i>

232
00:16:06,256 --> 00:16:09,218
<i>Polisi menemukan</i>
<i>tujuh kotak narkoba sintetis</i>

233
00:16:09,301 --> 00:16:12,429
<i>yang disamarkan jadi peralatan TI</i>
<i>saat penggerebekan.</i>

234
00:16:13,013 --> 00:16:15,057
<i>Jumlah itu cukup untuk 10.000 orang</i>

235
00:16:15,140 --> 00:16:17,267
<i>dan diperkirakan bernilai 1,2 miliar won.</i>

236
00:16:17,351 --> 00:16:19,603
<i>Kemasan yang mereka gunakan</i>

237
00:16:20,187 --> 00:16:23,691
<i>memiliki tanda dagang</i>
<i>jaringan narkoba dalam negeri.</i>

238
00:16:33,450 --> 00:16:35,703
<i>…menembakkan taser ke sandera,</i>

239
00:16:35,786 --> 00:16:39,540
<i>meski sepenuhnya sadar</i>
<i>akan bahayanya bagi sandera.</i>

240
00:16:39,623 --> 00:16:43,335
<i>Apa menangkap pelaku</i>
<i>lebih penting dari keselamatan sandera?</i>

241
00:16:43,419 --> 00:16:45,379
<i>Menangkap penjahat memang penting,</i>

242
00:16:45,462 --> 00:16:49,383
<i>tapi jika nyawa dijadikan taruhan,</i>
<i>harus dipertimbangkan lagi</i>…

243
00:16:49,466 --> 00:16:51,677
Astaga.

244
00:16:51,760 --> 00:16:53,429
<i>Saya Jo A-ra dari YTN News.</i>

245
00:16:53,512 --> 00:16:55,639
Wah, bicaranya lihai sekali.

246
00:16:55,723 --> 00:16:58,767
Begitulah sifatnya.
Makanya dijuluki Biang Kerok.

247
00:16:58,851 --> 00:16:59,935
- Abaikan saja.
- Pak…

248
00:17:01,437 --> 00:17:02,479
- Tunggu. Dia?
- Kenapa?

249
00:17:03,063 --> 00:17:04,815
Itu wartawan biang kerok.

250
00:17:05,566 --> 00:17:07,985
- Apa harus kita ceramahi?
- Tak usah.

251
00:17:09,778 --> 00:17:11,989
Ada apa? Dia melambaikan kopi kaleng.

252
00:17:12,072 --> 00:17:12,906
Aku…

253
00:17:14,825 --> 00:17:16,452
Dia mau bertemu kau.

254
00:17:16,952 --> 00:17:18,746
- Hadapilah.
- Hadapi apa? Hei.

255
00:17:19,872 --> 00:17:20,873
Aku lihat beritamu.

256
00:17:21,707 --> 00:17:22,916
Bagi Pak Detektif,

257
00:17:23,000 --> 00:17:25,627
berita itu mungkin
akan sangat menyinggung.

258
00:17:25,711 --> 00:17:28,547
Mohon dimengerti, ya.
Kita sama-sama profesional.

259
00:17:29,423 --> 00:17:31,925
Kuakui berita itu sedikit provokatif,

260
00:17:32,009 --> 00:17:35,554
tapi publik berhak tahu
dan harus terus mengikuti berita.

261
00:17:36,055 --> 00:17:37,723
Anggap itu pengorbanan kecil.

262
00:17:38,557 --> 00:17:39,516
Kau sengaja, 'kan?

263
00:17:40,267 --> 00:17:42,936
Aku cuma kerja. Kau tak terluka?
Coba kulihat.

264
00:17:44,855 --> 00:17:45,898
Kau masih menyukaiku?

265
00:17:48,067 --> 00:17:49,026
Berhentilah.

266
00:17:50,027 --> 00:17:52,696
Yang benar saja.
Kebaikanku kauanggap begitu?

267
00:17:54,239 --> 00:17:56,950
- Ya, benar. Aku menyukaimu.
- Hentikan.

268
00:17:57,034 --> 00:17:58,452
- Berhenti.
- Aku suka.

269
00:17:58,535 --> 00:18:02,039
- Itu dulu. Cuma suka sedikit.
- Kubilang, berhenti. Jangan.

270
00:18:02,122 --> 00:18:03,999
Tapi kau membuatku membencimu.

271
00:18:08,712 --> 00:18:09,797
Baiklah.

272
00:18:09,880 --> 00:18:12,132
Lain waktu, ayo makan
dan minum bersama. Dah!

273
00:18:14,301 --> 00:18:16,845
Dia mengajakku makan atau minum?

274
00:18:17,346 --> 00:18:19,098
Hwang Choong-sik, aku sibuk!

275
00:18:19,181 --> 00:18:21,100
Hei! Kapan?

276
00:18:21,183 --> 00:18:22,643
KOMPETISI PIDATO BAHASA INGGRIS

277
00:18:22,726 --> 00:18:24,478
- Astaga. Tak apa-apa?
- Maaf. Ya.

278
00:18:26,146 --> 00:18:28,774
KURSI KELUARGA HWANG YEON-JU
KELAS 2-4

279
00:18:34,530 --> 00:18:36,031
Bocah itu…

280
00:18:37,116 --> 00:18:38,909
Orang tua Yeon-ju sudah datang?

281
00:18:38,992 --> 00:18:40,702
- Ya, di sini.
- Ya.

282
00:18:46,125 --> 00:18:47,459
Bukan, aku ayahnya.

283
00:18:48,043 --> 00:18:51,171
Baik. Jika Yeon-ju datang,
tolong antar ke ruang tunggu.

284
00:18:51,255 --> 00:18:52,422
Baik.

285
00:18:54,925 --> 00:18:55,759
Oi.

286
00:18:56,301 --> 00:18:58,637
Namaku Lee Min-seok, bukan "Oi".

287
00:18:58,720 --> 00:19:00,472
Aku tak peduli namamu.

288
00:19:00,973 --> 00:19:02,599
Kenapa duduk di kursiku?

289
00:19:02,683 --> 00:19:03,934
Apa maksudmu?

290
00:19:04,434 --> 00:19:05,644
Aku ayahnya Yeon-ju.

291
00:19:05,727 --> 00:19:08,689
Apa katamu?
Tertulis di sini, "kursi keluarga".

292
00:19:08,772 --> 00:19:09,982
Aku juga tahu.

293
00:19:10,482 --> 00:19:12,484
Karena itu, aku duduk di sini.

294
00:19:16,947 --> 00:19:18,365
Halo, Semuanya.

295
00:19:18,866 --> 00:19:20,409
Namaku…

296
00:19:23,078 --> 00:19:24,746
Yeon-ju, kau baik-baik saja?

297
00:19:24,830 --> 00:19:26,790
Ya, aku tak peduli lagi.

298
00:19:28,625 --> 00:19:29,918
SUAMIKU

299
00:19:30,586 --> 00:19:32,588
Halo, Min-seok. Kami hampir tiba.

300
00:19:32,671 --> 00:19:33,839
<i>Kau di mana?</i>

301
00:19:33,922 --> 00:19:36,508
Kami di perempatan Pasar Eunhaeng.
Macet sekali.

302
00:19:37,009 --> 00:19:39,011
Tapi kami harus mampir ke apotek.

303
00:19:39,094 --> 00:19:40,762
Yeon-ju agak batuk.

304
00:19:40,846 --> 00:19:42,389
Aku baik-baik saja!

305
00:19:42,472 --> 00:19:44,141
Aku sudah bilang kepada Ibu.

306
00:19:44,224 --> 00:19:46,435
<i>Mampirlah ke apotek</i>
<i>dan hati-hati di jalan.</i>

307
00:19:47,019 --> 00:19:48,437
Ya, kami segera ke sana.

308
00:19:49,146 --> 00:19:50,480
KELUARGA HWANG YEON-JU

309
00:19:51,773 --> 00:19:52,608
Astaga…

310
00:19:52,691 --> 00:19:55,903
"Baiklah, sampai nanti."
Bicara kalian sopan sekali.

311
00:19:55,986 --> 00:19:58,989
Tak bisakah duduk di tempat lain?
Ada banyak kursi.

312
00:19:59,072 --> 00:20:00,949
Kau saja yang pergi.

313
00:20:07,706 --> 00:20:09,875
Serius. Kenapa kau datang ke sini?

314
00:20:10,834 --> 00:20:11,919
Apa maksudmu?

315
00:20:12,544 --> 00:20:13,670
Ini acara anakku.

316
00:20:13,754 --> 00:20:16,048
Aku bercerai dengan istriku, bukan anakku!

317
00:20:17,090 --> 00:20:18,884
Mohon maaf.

318
00:20:19,384 --> 00:20:20,427
Maaf.

319
00:20:21,303 --> 00:20:24,306
Meski begitu, akulah suaminya sekarang.

320
00:20:24,848 --> 00:20:26,266
Jaga sopan santunmu.

321
00:20:26,350 --> 00:20:29,394
Bisa-bisanya kau membahas sopan santun.

322
00:20:29,478 --> 00:20:31,480
Oi, kau shio Anjing, 'kan?

323
00:20:31,563 --> 00:20:33,941
Shio kita sama, artinya beda 12 tahun.

324
00:20:34,024 --> 00:20:36,235
Saat aku masuk kuliah, kau masuk SD.

325
00:20:36,318 --> 00:20:39,363
Waktu kuliah,
ada SD di depan asrama kampusku.

326
00:20:39,446 --> 00:20:40,989
Saat aku merokok di sana,

327
00:20:41,073 --> 00:20:42,783
"Pak, ini bagaimana caranya?"

328
00:20:42,866 --> 00:20:44,785
kata anak yang main mesin capit. Itu kau.

329
00:20:44,868 --> 00:20:47,287
- Kau mau pamerkan sifat kolotmu?
- Ya.

330
00:20:47,955 --> 00:20:49,122
Apa-apaan ini?

331
00:20:49,206 --> 00:20:50,999
Ya ampun, tak habis pikir.

332
00:20:51,083 --> 00:20:53,001
Kenapa begini di tempat umum?

333
00:20:53,085 --> 00:20:55,254
Astaga. Apa yang kaulakukan?

334
00:20:56,880 --> 00:20:58,382
Tunggu di mobil sebentar.

335
00:21:21,154 --> 00:21:22,906
Dia selalu seperti ini.

336
00:21:22,990 --> 00:21:24,074
Kenapa belum datang?

337
00:21:24,157 --> 00:21:27,327
Baru pertama kali begini.
Ponselnya pun mati.

338
00:21:27,411 --> 00:21:29,705
"Pertama kali"? Omong kosong.

339
00:21:34,626 --> 00:21:35,752
NOMOR TAK DIKENAL

340
00:21:36,628 --> 00:21:39,214
- Halo?
<i>- Ini Detektif Hwang Choong-sik?</i>

341
00:21:39,298 --> 00:21:41,383
<i>Dengar baik-baik. Tak akan kuulang.</i>

342
00:21:41,466 --> 00:21:43,385
Apa itu Si-nae?

343
00:21:45,512 --> 00:21:46,346
Ini siapa?

344
00:21:46,430 --> 00:21:48,807
<i>Istri dan anakmu ada bersama kami.</i>

345
00:21:49,308 --> 00:21:51,601
<i>Aku hanya meminta satu hal.</i>

346
00:21:51,685 --> 00:21:52,602
<i>Suamiku.</i>

347
00:21:52,686 --> 00:21:54,313
"Suami"? Apa maksudmu?

348
00:21:54,396 --> 00:21:56,148
Ada masalah dengan Si-nae dan Yeon-ju?

349
00:21:56,231 --> 00:21:59,860
<i>Suamiku yang kautangkap, Ma Do-jun.</i>

350
00:22:00,360 --> 00:22:01,653
<i>Kembalikan kepadaku.</i>

351
00:22:01,737 --> 00:22:04,614
<i>Jika kau lapor polisi atau macam-macam,</i>

352
00:22:04,698 --> 00:22:06,742
<i>akan kucabut jari, lidah,</i>

353
00:22:06,825 --> 00:22:09,036
<i>dan bola mata istrimu satu per satu.</i>

354
00:22:09,119 --> 00:22:10,746
<i>Berikutnya giliran putrimu.</i>

355
00:22:11,246 --> 00:22:13,749
<i>Kuberi tahu lokasinya nanti.</i>
<i>Tunggu teleponku.</i>

356
00:22:13,832 --> 00:22:16,001
Halo? Ha… Hei! Halo?

357
00:22:17,336 --> 00:22:19,212
Kenapa? Ada masalah apa?

358
00:22:19,838 --> 00:22:22,382
Terakhir Si-nae di mana
saat menghubungimu?

359
00:22:22,466 --> 00:22:23,925
- Apotek.
- Pasar Eunhaeng.

360
00:22:24,009 --> 00:22:26,178
Hei, kenapa? Apa yang terjadi?

361
00:22:26,678 --> 00:22:28,347
Si-nae dan Yeon-ju diculik.

362
00:22:36,730 --> 00:22:37,564
Turunlah.

363
00:22:38,398 --> 00:22:39,232
Tidak akan.

364
00:22:39,316 --> 00:22:42,569
Aku akan menyelamatkan putriku
dan istrimu sekalian.

365
00:22:42,652 --> 00:22:44,154
Kau tunggu saja di rumah.

366
00:22:44,237 --> 00:22:45,489
Aku juga harus pergi.

367
00:22:45,572 --> 00:22:47,324
Tak ada waktu main-main!

368
00:22:48,200 --> 00:22:49,493
Si-nae…

369
00:22:51,328 --> 00:22:52,329
sedang hamil.

370
00:22:52,412 --> 00:22:53,455
Apa?

371
00:22:53,538 --> 00:22:56,792
Dia hamil tiga bulan.
Dia sedang mengandung.

372
00:22:58,001 --> 00:22:59,586
Jadi, aku harus ikut.

373
00:23:01,880 --> 00:23:03,048
Dia hamil?

374
00:23:03,131 --> 00:23:04,674
Kenapa diam? Ayo cepat!

375
00:23:06,468 --> 00:23:07,552
Sial.

376
00:23:09,679 --> 00:23:10,847
Ini tempatnya.

377
00:23:12,933 --> 00:23:14,935
Kau lihat ada orang mencurigakan?

378
00:23:15,018 --> 00:23:16,561
- Orang mencurigakan?
- Ya.

379
00:23:17,062 --> 00:23:18,438
Tidak.

380
00:23:18,522 --> 00:23:20,315
Di sana. Itu mobilnya!

381
00:23:27,781 --> 00:23:28,824
Yeon-ju.

382
00:23:34,996 --> 00:23:36,081
<i>Ibu!</i>

383
00:23:36,164 --> 00:23:38,083
- Yeon-ju!
<i>- Ibu!</i>

384
00:23:38,166 --> 00:23:39,042
Bagaimana ini?

385
00:23:39,126 --> 00:23:40,752
- Hei, diam dulu.
<i>- Ibu!</i>

386
00:23:40,836 --> 00:23:41,795
<i>Yeon-ju!</i>

387
00:23:43,046 --> 00:23:43,880
Si-nae.

388
00:23:48,009 --> 00:23:48,969
<i>Lepaskan!</i>

389
00:23:52,806 --> 00:23:53,807
- Bajingan.
- Sialan.

390
00:23:54,683 --> 00:23:55,767
<i>Ayo berangkat.</i>

391
00:24:02,441 --> 00:24:03,316
NOMOR TAK DIKENAL

392
00:24:09,489 --> 00:24:10,323
<i>Aku Si-nae.</i>

393
00:24:10,407 --> 00:24:11,658
Si-nae.

394
00:24:11,741 --> 00:24:12,826
Si-nae!

395
00:24:13,743 --> 00:24:15,954
Kau tak apa-apa? Yeon-ju bagaimana?

396
00:24:16,037 --> 00:24:17,205
<i>Dia baik-baik saja.</i>

397
00:24:17,289 --> 00:24:19,541
Si-nae, dengar aku baik-baik.

398
00:24:20,375 --> 00:24:22,210
Ingat apa yang pernah kubilang?

399
00:24:23,003 --> 00:24:24,254
Level bir,

400
00:24:24,796 --> 00:24:26,882
soju, dan wiski.

401
00:24:26,965 --> 00:24:28,800
<i>Ya, aku ingat.</i>

402
00:24:28,884 --> 00:24:29,801
Apa situasinya?

403
00:24:33,138 --> 00:24:34,639
Level baijiu.

404
00:24:35,891 --> 00:24:37,267
Kenapa? Apa artinya?

405
00:24:39,603 --> 00:24:40,520
Si-nae.

406
00:24:41,104 --> 00:24:43,231
Jangan cari gara-gara dengan mereka.

407
00:24:43,315 --> 00:24:46,318
Lakukan semua yang disuruh
dan jangan memberi celah.

408
00:24:46,902 --> 00:24:48,528
Tak perlu terpancing emosi.

409
00:24:50,280 --> 00:24:51,198
Baiklah.

410
00:24:51,698 --> 00:24:53,617
Sudah dengar suara Ny. Baijiu?

411
00:24:54,910 --> 00:24:56,286
Kuturuti maumu. Apa?

412
00:24:56,870 --> 00:24:58,914
<i>Jika mau lihat istri dan putrimu,</i>

413
00:24:58,997 --> 00:25:01,708
bawalah suamiku sebelum pukul 21.00.

414
00:25:02,375 --> 00:25:04,419
Apa? Pukul 21.00? Itu terlalu…

415
00:25:04,503 --> 00:25:06,963
- Apa yang kaulakukan?
- Akan kuturuti, Bu.

416
00:25:07,047 --> 00:25:08,882
<i>Jangan sakiti mereka berdua.</i>

417
00:25:08,965 --> 00:25:10,550
- Hei, berhenti!
- Aku mohon!

418
00:25:11,259 --> 00:25:13,178
- Diam!
- Woi! Akan kubunuh kau!

419
00:25:13,261 --> 00:25:14,930
<i>- Hei!</i>
- Apa-apaan ini?

420
00:25:15,013 --> 00:25:16,097
Bajingan!

421
00:25:16,181 --> 00:25:17,015
Kubunuh kau!

422
00:25:17,891 --> 00:25:20,018
Kau akan kubunuh!

423
00:25:20,101 --> 00:25:20,936
<i>Itu siapa?</i>

424
00:25:21,019 --> 00:25:22,646
Tidak, tadi itu aku.

425
00:25:22,729 --> 00:25:24,231
Maaf, aku tiba-tiba emosi.

426
00:25:24,314 --> 00:25:25,690
Oke. Kutepati janjiku.

427
00:25:26,191 --> 00:25:28,610
Tapi kau harus jamin keselamatan mereka.

428
00:25:28,693 --> 00:25:30,820
Aku harus bawa suamimu ke mana?

429
00:25:30,904 --> 00:25:32,614
Tanyalah kepada suamiku.

430
00:25:33,532 --> 00:25:35,367
Hei. Halo?

431
00:25:37,911 --> 00:25:39,579
Ini polisi, ya? Sekarang…

432
00:25:39,663 --> 00:25:41,331
Dasar bajingan tolol.

433
00:25:41,831 --> 00:25:43,708
Jika melapor, mereka bisa mati!

434
00:25:44,668 --> 00:25:46,545
Lakukanlah sesuatu.

435
00:25:47,045 --> 00:25:47,963
Ini salahmu.

436
00:25:48,046 --> 00:25:50,173
Ini karena kau menangkap dia!

437
00:25:53,510 --> 00:25:54,511
Jadi, apa rencanamu?

438
00:25:54,594 --> 00:25:57,305
Aku sedang memikirkan rencananya.

439
00:25:57,931 --> 00:26:00,559
Oi, bukannya kau yang menangkap Ma Do-jun?

440
00:26:00,642 --> 00:26:02,018
Dasar kurang ajar.

441
00:26:02,102 --> 00:26:03,728
Panggil aku yang benar.

442
00:26:03,812 --> 00:26:07,023
Kau juga bicara yang sopan.
Umurku 32 tahun.

443
00:26:07,107 --> 00:26:09,109
Dasar bocah ingusan.

444
00:26:09,192 --> 00:26:10,944
Kau tahu <i>Future Boy Conan?</i>

445
00:26:11,027 --> 00:26:13,405
- Aku tahu <i>Detective Conan.</i>
- Dokter Anjing.

446
00:26:13,488 --> 00:26:15,574
- Apa, Polisi Bangsat?
- Polisi Bangsat?

447
00:26:15,657 --> 00:26:17,200
Kau sudah bosan hidup?

448
00:26:17,826 --> 00:26:19,369
Kau ini benar-benar…

449
00:26:19,452 --> 00:26:21,162
Perhatikan jalan yang benar.

450
00:26:21,746 --> 00:26:23,582
Ya ampun…

451
00:26:24,499 --> 00:26:26,376
Kita menuju ke mana sekarang?

452
00:26:26,459 --> 00:26:29,421
Kita ke kantor polisi
yang kausukai itu. Kenapa?

453
00:26:29,504 --> 00:26:30,922
KANTOR POLISI INCHEON GANGBUK

454
00:26:31,006 --> 00:26:33,216
Ma Do-jun akan diserahkan ke kejaksaan.

455
00:26:33,300 --> 00:26:35,635
Jika sudah di tangan jaksa,
sulit untuk dikeluarkan.

456
00:26:35,719 --> 00:26:37,012
Lalu mau bagaimana?

457
00:26:37,095 --> 00:26:38,555
Keluarkan di perjalanan.

458
00:26:40,098 --> 00:26:40,932
Aku harus apa?

459
00:26:42,475 --> 00:26:45,020
Kembalilah ke klinik
dan beri makan anjing.

460
00:26:45,604 --> 00:26:48,607
Bukankah kita harus kerja sama
dan melakukan operasi gabungan?

461
00:26:48,690 --> 00:26:50,317
Pasti sering menonton film.

462
00:26:50,400 --> 00:26:52,027
Operasi gabungan? Itu konyol.

463
00:26:57,115 --> 00:26:57,949
Hei.

464
00:26:58,617 --> 00:26:59,451
Kau bisa menyetir?

465
00:27:02,245 --> 00:27:03,747
Pembalap mobil pun kalah.

466
00:27:03,830 --> 00:27:05,832
Panjat tebing, terjun payung…

467
00:27:05,915 --> 00:27:07,792
Hobiku adalah olahraga ekstrem.

468
00:27:07,876 --> 00:27:08,752
Bagus.

469
00:27:09,294 --> 00:27:13,256
Akan kuubah rutenya ke tempat yang pas,
lalu tabraklah mobil kami.

470
00:27:13,340 --> 00:27:14,924
Buat kecelakaan disengaja.

471
00:27:15,008 --> 00:27:17,385
Saat itu, kita keluarkan Ma Do-jun.
Bagaimana?

472
00:27:18,345 --> 00:27:19,179
Baiklah.

473
00:27:19,262 --> 00:27:21,181
Beri tahu saja targetnya.

474
00:27:21,681 --> 00:27:23,558
Akan kutabrak tepat di bagian samping

475
00:27:23,642 --> 00:27:25,935
supaya tidak ada yang terluka

476
00:27:26,019 --> 00:27:28,730
dan mobilnya terbalik 135 derajat.

477
00:27:28,813 --> 00:27:29,814
Mobilnya saja.

478
00:27:31,441 --> 00:27:32,817
Apa kau bercanda?

479
00:27:34,569 --> 00:27:37,197
- Aku terlihat bercanda?
- Lantas apa itu?

480
00:27:43,703 --> 00:27:46,956
Aku pemanjat. Tepatnya pemanjat tebing.

481
00:27:47,040 --> 00:27:49,209
Apa kau paham olahraga ekstrem?

482
00:27:49,292 --> 00:27:50,543
Sialan…

483
00:27:50,627 --> 00:27:52,671
Mana mungkin aku tak tahu itu?

484
00:27:52,754 --> 00:27:55,590
- Semacam permainan Go dan remi, 'kan?
- Apa?

485
00:27:56,675 --> 00:27:57,509
Pokoknya,

486
00:27:58,009 --> 00:28:00,428
siapkan mobil yang tak mencolok.

487
00:28:02,222 --> 00:28:04,265
Ada mobil yang tepat untuk misi ini.

488
00:28:06,518 --> 00:28:07,394
Jangan cemas.

489
00:28:23,076 --> 00:28:25,912
Sudah berapa lama kau tak menyetir?

490
00:28:25,995 --> 00:28:29,374
Hei. Aku yang menangkapnya,
jadi aku yang tanggung jawab.

491
00:28:29,457 --> 00:28:31,710
Sudahlah. Pakai sabuk pengaman.

492
00:28:31,793 --> 00:28:34,087
Untuk apa? Tempatnya dekat.

493
00:28:34,170 --> 00:28:35,255
Pakai saja!

494
00:28:35,839 --> 00:28:36,715
Baiklah.

495
00:28:37,382 --> 00:28:38,383
Di belakang juga.

496
00:28:38,466 --> 00:28:40,260
Apa? Kami juga?

497
00:28:40,343 --> 00:28:43,304
Ya, kalian juga.
Kumohon, pakailah sabuknya!

498
00:28:43,388 --> 00:28:45,724
Baiklah, kami akan pakai sabuk.

499
00:28:45,807 --> 00:28:47,142
Dia kenapa hari ini?

500
00:28:47,225 --> 00:28:50,729
Pakai saja. Jangan buat
bapak kolot itu emosi. Cepatlah.

501
00:28:57,360 --> 00:28:59,779
<i>Siapkan mobil yang tak mencolok.</i>

502
00:29:00,280 --> 00:29:04,033
<i>Ada mobil yang tepat untuk misi ini.</i>
<i>Jangan cemas.</i>

503
00:29:07,787 --> 00:29:09,164
Sial…

504
00:29:34,856 --> 00:29:36,775
<i>Dalam 8,5 detik, sampai 100 km per jam.</i>

505
00:29:36,858 --> 00:29:38,276
<i>Temperatur 22 derajat.</i>

506
00:29:39,235 --> 00:29:41,613
<i>Berat van 60 banding 40</i>
<i>antara depan dan belakang.</i>

507
00:29:44,449 --> 00:29:46,576
<i>Rem tangan pada 90 km per jam,</i>
<i>putar setir.</i>

508
00:29:47,410 --> 00:29:49,579
<i>Jejak selip pada sudut 37 derajat.</i>

509
00:29:50,079 --> 00:29:53,333
<i>Hantam tepat 21 cm di atas roda belakang.</i>

510
00:29:53,416 --> 00:29:55,126
<i>Di atas roda belakang, 21 cm.</i>

511
00:29:56,127 --> 00:29:57,128
<i>Pada titik itu</i>

512
00:29:57,629 --> 00:29:59,964
<i>mobil akan terbalik 135 derajat.</i>

513
00:30:43,049 --> 00:30:44,425
Apa-apaan itu?

514
00:30:45,176 --> 00:30:46,177
Astaga.

515
00:30:46,261 --> 00:30:48,137
Apa yang mobil itu lakukan?

516
00:30:49,931 --> 00:30:50,974
Apa?

517
00:30:54,018 --> 00:30:55,311
Dasar

518
00:30:55,812 --> 00:30:56,980
bajingan…

519
00:31:26,926 --> 00:31:28,928
Kau tak apa-apa?

520
00:31:30,221 --> 00:31:33,016
- Bagaimana ini?
- Ma Do-jun di belakang. Keluarkan.

521
00:31:44,235 --> 00:31:45,320
Ma Do-jun.

522
00:31:46,779 --> 00:31:47,864
Bajingan.

523
00:31:50,575 --> 00:31:52,660
Ma Do-jun! Dasar bajingan!

524
00:31:52,744 --> 00:31:55,288
{\an8}- Sini kuncinya.
- Apa maksudmu? Aku saja.

525
00:31:55,371 --> 00:31:58,291
- Aku hafal area ini. Cepat.
- Astaga…

526
00:32:08,301 --> 00:32:11,137
Ma Do-jun! Bajingan!

527
00:32:11,220 --> 00:32:12,931
Kemari kau, Bangsat!

528
00:32:13,014 --> 00:32:14,140
Hei!

529
00:32:14,223 --> 00:32:16,726
Hei! Di sini!

530
00:32:19,520 --> 00:32:20,772
- Siapa dia?
- Pak.

531
00:32:20,855 --> 00:32:22,815
Siapa yang menyergap mobil polisi?

532
00:32:24,692 --> 00:32:26,653
Identitasnya baru terkonfirmasi.

533
00:32:26,736 --> 00:32:29,113
Pelakunya Yong-gang yang baru bebas.

534
00:32:29,197 --> 00:32:30,657
- Kim Yong-gang?
- Benar.

535
00:32:30,740 --> 00:32:33,493
Yong-gang yang baru bebas
menyerang Ma Do-jun?

536
00:32:34,744 --> 00:32:36,746
Duel antara dua jaringan narkoba?

537
00:32:40,959 --> 00:32:41,960
{\an8}Siapa dia?

538
00:32:42,043 --> 00:32:44,796
{\an8}Siapa bajingan yang menyergap
Detektif Hwang dan Ma Do-jun?

539
00:32:45,421 --> 00:32:47,674
Antara tim Yong-gang atau Ma Do-jun.

540
00:32:50,134 --> 00:32:52,345
{\an8}Tim Yong-gang atau Ma Do-jun rupanya.

541
00:32:55,056 --> 00:32:56,599
{\an8}Dasar…

542
00:32:57,100 --> 00:32:58,935
{\an8}Tapi pakai mobil klinik hewan?

543
00:32:59,018 --> 00:33:01,396
{\an8}Itu penyamaran. Penyamaran yang rapi.

544
00:33:01,479 --> 00:33:03,606
{\an8}Penyamaran rupanya.

545
00:33:04,899 --> 00:33:06,985
{\an8}- Cari dia.
- Dia tak ada di sistem.

546
00:33:08,486 --> 00:33:09,654
{\an8}Berhenti!

547
00:33:15,576 --> 00:33:16,828
{\an8}Ternyata dia Pak Lee!

548
00:33:16,911 --> 00:33:18,871
- Pak Lee?
- Pak Hwang menangkapnya?

549
00:33:18,955 --> 00:33:20,540
- Pak Lee yang itu?
- Ahli narkoba?

550
00:33:20,623 --> 00:33:22,333
- Pak Lee?
- Tunggu sebentar.

551
00:33:23,376 --> 00:33:24,293
Putar mundur.

552
00:33:25,336 --> 00:33:26,629
Mundur lagi.

553
00:33:27,296 --> 00:33:29,966
Dia melempar kunci mobil.
Choong-sik menangkapnya.

554
00:33:31,968 --> 00:33:32,802
Dilempar?

555
00:33:33,553 --> 00:33:34,554
Ditangkap?

556
00:33:35,054 --> 00:33:35,930
Dilempar

557
00:33:37,015 --> 00:33:37,849
dan ditangkap…

558
00:33:41,644 --> 00:33:43,187
Ini rencananya Choong-sik.

559
00:33:45,148 --> 00:33:46,816
{\an8}Keahlian penting bagi polisi

560
00:33:47,650 --> 00:33:49,068
{\an8}adalah berpikir cepat.

561
00:33:49,152 --> 00:33:51,112
{\an8}Detektif Woo, katakan.

562
00:33:51,612 --> 00:33:53,406
{\an8}Siapa yang bawa mesin cuci ke kantor?

563
00:33:53,489 --> 00:33:54,782
{\an8}Pak Hwang yang bawa.

564
00:33:54,866 --> 00:33:55,700
{\an8}Mesin cuci.

565
00:33:56,200 --> 00:33:57,326
{\an8}Oven mikrogelombang.

566
00:33:58,077 --> 00:34:00,455
{\an8}- Pengering baju juga.
- Pengering baju.

567
00:34:01,456 --> 00:34:03,166
{\an8}Itu dari rumahnya Choong-sik.

568
00:34:03,249 --> 00:34:04,876
{\an8}Dia tak punya rumah.

569
00:34:04,959 --> 00:34:06,794
{\an8}Ruang kendali jadi kamar tidur.

570
00:34:06,878 --> 00:34:08,004
{\an8}Ruang interogasi…

571
00:34:08,087 --> 00:34:09,172
{\an8}Kamar cadangan.

572
00:34:09,881 --> 00:34:11,257
{\an8}Ruang Divisi Detektif?

573
00:34:12,133 --> 00:34:13,760
{\an8}- Ruang keluarga?
- Benar.

574
00:34:14,677 --> 00:34:17,513
{\an8}Dia tak punya jalan mundur,
selalu berjalan maju.

575
00:34:17,597 --> 00:34:20,683
{\an8}Siapa pun targetnya,
pasti akan dia tangkap.

576
00:34:20,767 --> 00:34:22,185
{\an8}Bahkan saat terluka,

577
00:34:22,268 --> 00:34:25,188
{\an8}Ma Do-jun tak akan dilepas.
Dia gesit dan cerdik.

578
00:34:26,064 --> 00:34:28,608
{\an8}Responsnya di lapangan sangat sempurna!

579
00:34:30,610 --> 00:34:32,653
HWANG CHOONG-SIK

580
00:34:34,322 --> 00:34:35,448
KEPALA OTAK AYAM

581
00:34:43,414 --> 00:34:44,999
- Sialan.
- Hei.

582
00:34:45,083 --> 00:34:45,917
Sial.

583
00:34:47,460 --> 00:34:48,753
Persetan.

584
00:34:48,836 --> 00:34:49,962
<i>Halo?</i>

585
00:34:52,965 --> 00:34:54,092
Ini Burung Hantu.

586
00:34:54,675 --> 00:34:55,718
<i>Kau dengar?</i>

587
00:34:58,179 --> 00:34:59,263
Sulit bicara?

588
00:34:59,347 --> 00:35:00,598
<i>Begitu situasinya?</i>

589
00:35:01,641 --> 00:35:02,767
Aku paham rencanamu.

590
00:35:03,267 --> 00:35:06,437
Aku siap berikan bantuan.
Fokuslah pada rencanamu.

591
00:35:07,313 --> 00:35:08,689
<i>Jika sempat,</i>

592
00:35:08,773 --> 00:35:10,942
<i>segera hubungi sarang Burung Hantu.</i>

593
00:35:11,025 --> 00:35:11,901
Sekian.

594
00:35:15,613 --> 00:35:16,447
Ada apa?

595
00:35:17,698 --> 00:35:20,034
- Katanya dia Burung Hantu.
- Burung Hantu?

596
00:35:21,577 --> 00:35:23,704
Aku tak paham apa maksudnya.

597
00:35:30,711 --> 00:35:33,506
Mata ganti mata, gigi ganti gigi.

598
00:35:34,006 --> 00:35:37,802
Suamimu yang polisi itu
memenjarakan suamiku.

599
00:35:37,885 --> 00:35:40,888
Aku cuma membalas
dengan menyekap keluarganya.

600
00:35:43,432 --> 00:35:46,936
Tapi satu ucapanmu itu benar
dan satu lagi salah.

601
00:35:47,937 --> 00:35:50,565
Polisi yang kaumaksud itu

602
00:35:50,648 --> 00:35:53,609
bukan suamiku saat ini,
melainkan mantan suamiku.

603
00:35:56,362 --> 00:35:57,363
Suamimu ada dua?

604
00:35:58,114 --> 00:35:59,115
Ya.

605
00:35:59,198 --> 00:36:00,283
Beruntung sekali.

606
00:36:01,868 --> 00:36:03,619
Siapa suamimu yang sekarang?

607
00:36:04,120 --> 00:36:04,996
Dia dokter.

608
00:36:06,080 --> 00:36:08,791
- Tapi mantan Pasukan Khusus.
- Pasukan Khusus?

609
00:36:08,875 --> 00:36:12,587
Ahli penyusupan, peledak,
pengumpul info, dan operasi antiteror.

610
00:36:13,087 --> 00:36:14,547
Dia mantan Pasukan Khusus.

611
00:36:14,630 --> 00:36:16,424
Kau membuat kesalahan.

612
00:36:16,507 --> 00:36:18,217
Mau pasukan khusus atau bukan,

613
00:36:18,301 --> 00:36:20,011
aku tak peduli suami barumu.

614
00:36:20,094 --> 00:36:21,429
Jadi, kalau dirangkum,

615
00:36:21,512 --> 00:36:24,348
mantan suami
yang hubungannya buruk denganmu itu

616
00:36:25,057 --> 00:36:26,601
mungkin tak akan menyelamatkanmu.

617
00:36:28,144 --> 00:36:29,520
Mungkin begitu.

618
00:36:29,604 --> 00:36:31,355
Tapi dia akan menangkapmu.

619
00:36:31,939 --> 00:36:33,608
Kalian salah pilih lawan.

620
00:36:38,779 --> 00:36:41,741
Hei, tadi siapa
yang menabrak di tengah jalan?

621
00:36:41,824 --> 00:36:42,658
Anak buahmu?

622
00:36:43,659 --> 00:36:45,411
Mungkin benar, mungkin tidak.

623
00:36:45,494 --> 00:36:47,538
Jawab yang benar, Bajingan!

624
00:36:47,622 --> 00:36:50,917
Banyak bajingan sinting yang teler
dan ingin membunuhku.

625
00:36:51,000 --> 00:36:52,251
- Salah satunya.
- Tunggu.

626
00:36:53,628 --> 00:36:54,503
Dia bohong.

627
00:36:54,587 --> 00:36:55,588
Apa?

628
00:36:55,671 --> 00:36:57,840
Manusia dan hewan itu sama.

629
00:36:58,341 --> 00:37:00,593
Ada manusia yang mirip rusa sepertiku.

630
00:37:00,676 --> 00:37:03,262
Ada manusia yang mirip monyet sepertimu.

631
00:37:04,472 --> 00:37:06,140
Lihatlah sorot matanya.

632
00:37:07,391 --> 00:37:08,309
Pupilnya bergetar.

633
00:37:09,352 --> 00:37:10,186
Dia berbohong.

634
00:37:11,062 --> 00:37:11,896
Kalau dia apa?

635
00:37:12,396 --> 00:37:13,356
Dia anjing.

636
00:37:13,439 --> 00:37:14,899
Tapi sok jadi serigala.

637
00:37:16,567 --> 00:37:18,861
- Lidahnya menjulur?
- Dia senang.

638
00:37:19,362 --> 00:37:21,197
- Mengorek telinga?
- Tak mau dengar.

639
00:37:23,449 --> 00:37:26,035
Diam kau, Bajingan! Awas saja.

640
00:37:26,118 --> 00:37:28,329
Waktumu tidak banyak. Kenapa?

641
00:37:28,412 --> 00:37:29,288
Karena aku tahu.

642
00:37:29,372 --> 00:37:33,501
Aku tahu cintaku merencanakan ini semua
untuk menyelamatkanku.

643
00:37:34,085 --> 00:37:37,004
Kalian menyandera istri
dan anakku di mana?

644
00:37:37,088 --> 00:37:38,506
Tempat itu tak muncul di GPS.

645
00:37:38,589 --> 00:37:41,175
Akan kuantarkan.
Aku bisa jadi GPS untukmu.

646
00:37:41,759 --> 00:37:44,679
"Ada pendeteksi kecepatan.
Gas sekencang mungkin."

647
00:37:45,763 --> 00:37:46,973
Dia tak mau menurut.

648
00:37:47,056 --> 00:37:48,975
"Ini zona selamat sekolah.

649
00:37:49,058 --> 00:37:50,851
Gas lebih kencang!"

650
00:37:50,935 --> 00:37:53,437
Apa kau senang? Bajingan.

651
00:37:54,814 --> 00:37:56,023
Hei. Apa-apaan ini?

652
00:37:56,107 --> 00:37:57,400
Supaya tak gonggong.

653
00:37:57,942 --> 00:37:59,068
- Ketat sekali!
- Apa…

654
00:37:59,151 --> 00:38:00,319
Biasa untuk anjing liar.

655
00:38:01,195 --> 00:38:03,322
Jawablah, di mana mereka?

656
00:38:03,823 --> 00:38:05,992
Kalian menyandera
Yeon-ju dan Si-nae di mana?

657
00:38:06,075 --> 00:38:07,326
Baiklah.

658
00:38:08,369 --> 00:38:09,245
Itu…

659
00:38:09,787 --> 00:38:10,997
Dasar bajingan!

660
00:38:18,170 --> 00:38:20,339
- Sudah kubilang berkali-kali!
- Tunggu. Halo?

661
00:38:20,423 --> 00:38:23,259
- Choong-sik di mana?
- Masih terus kami lacak.

662
00:38:23,342 --> 00:38:25,469
Astaga. Kenapa masih dilacak?

663
00:38:25,553 --> 00:38:27,680
- CCTV-nya?
- Sudah dapat datanya.

664
00:38:27,763 --> 00:38:29,390
Harus diamati lagi.

665
00:38:29,473 --> 00:38:32,518
- Tambah personel dan cepat pastikan.
- Baik, Pak.

666
00:38:32,601 --> 00:38:34,478
- Junior, kemarilah.
- Ya, Pak.

667
00:38:34,562 --> 00:38:37,064
Pukul berapa kecelakaan itu terekam CCTV?

668
00:38:37,148 --> 00:38:38,649
Pukul 16.35.

669
00:38:39,942 --> 00:38:41,277
Kenapa? Ada apa?

670
00:38:41,360 --> 00:38:43,612
Keluarlah. Ini area terlarang.

671
00:38:43,696 --> 00:38:44,613
Ya, baiklah.

672
00:38:44,697 --> 00:38:47,116
Mobil yang mengangkut kriminal diserang.

673
00:38:47,199 --> 00:38:49,994
Ma Do-jun dan Hwang Choong-sik menghilang.

674
00:38:50,077 --> 00:38:51,329
Tapi

675
00:38:51,412 --> 00:38:53,831
itu semua rencananya Hwang Choong-sik.

676
00:38:54,582 --> 00:38:55,416
Aku benar?

677
00:38:55,499 --> 00:38:57,335
Sama sekali tidak. Keluarlah.

678
00:38:57,418 --> 00:38:58,878
- Kau menghalangi tugas.
- Benar?

679
00:38:58,961 --> 00:39:00,379
- Cepat keluar.
- Aku benar.

680
00:39:00,463 --> 00:39:02,798
- Kak, tunggu.
- Sok akrab sekali.

681
00:39:06,052 --> 00:39:09,305
Ma Do-jun dan Hwang Choong-sik
menghilang bersama?

682
00:39:11,807 --> 00:39:15,770
Choong-sik, pencetak berita eksklusif.
Inilah alasanku menyukaimu.

683
00:39:17,855 --> 00:39:20,358
Hei, kau lihat? Suamimu kubebaskan.

684
00:39:20,441 --> 00:39:23,110
Aku tak peduli denganmu.
Mana suami aslinya?

685
00:39:23,694 --> 00:39:25,363
- Apa?
<i>- Suami sahnya.</i>

686
00:39:25,446 --> 00:39:28,366
<i>Aku ingin bicara</i>
<i>dengan suami yang sah secara hukum.</i>

687
00:39:29,825 --> 00:39:31,827
Ya, aku suami aslinya.

688
00:39:32,328 --> 00:39:33,287
Kau lihat dia?

689
00:39:33,371 --> 00:39:35,122
Sayang, kau baik-baik saja?

690
00:39:35,206 --> 00:39:36,665
Tentu saja. Kau sendiri?

691
00:39:36,749 --> 00:39:38,417
<i>Ini baru dua hari,</i>

692
00:39:38,501 --> 00:39:40,961
<i>tapi kau terlihat kurus sekali.</i>

693
00:39:41,754 --> 00:39:42,838
Tapi makin keren.

694
00:39:42,922 --> 00:39:44,965
Benar. Rahangku lebih tajam, ya?

695
00:39:45,466 --> 00:39:47,343
Omong kosong menjijikkan. Sial.

696
00:39:47,426 --> 00:39:50,805
Kalian berdua sudah aman,
jadi tunjukkan anak dan istriku.

697
00:39:54,350 --> 00:39:55,601
Yeon-ju!

698
00:39:55,684 --> 00:39:56,977
<i>Ayah!</i>

699
00:39:57,061 --> 00:39:59,230
Yeon-ju, ayahmu yang asli di sini.

700
00:39:59,313 --> 00:40:01,899
<i>Ayah akan menyelamatkanmu. Tunggulah. Oke?</i>

701
00:40:02,400 --> 00:40:04,527
<i>Yeon-ju, tenanglah. Jangan menangis.</i>

702
00:40:04,610 --> 00:40:06,195
<i>- Tak akan lama.</i>
<i>- Jangan menangis.</i>

703
00:40:07,321 --> 00:40:08,197
Si-nae.

704
00:40:08,280 --> 00:40:10,658
Jangan khawatir.
Kami akan menyelamatkanmu. Tunggu.

705
00:40:10,741 --> 00:40:12,493
Si-nae, kuatkan dirimu. Bertahan!

706
00:40:13,577 --> 00:40:14,703
<i>Syaratnya berubah.</i>

707
00:40:14,787 --> 00:40:17,665
Sebelum ke sini,
kalian harus ke suatu tempat.

708
00:40:17,748 --> 00:40:19,750
Dia sudah kubawa sesuai janji!

709
00:40:19,834 --> 00:40:23,838
Karena aku buru-buru,
aku lupa membawa Nabi.

710
00:40:23,921 --> 00:40:25,172
Ya Tuhan!

711
00:40:25,256 --> 00:40:27,675
Kenapa tak dibawa? Itu mahal!

712
00:40:27,758 --> 00:40:29,051
Tolong ambilkan.

713
00:40:29,135 --> 00:40:31,137
- Apa yang kalian bicarakan?
- Diam!

714
00:40:32,847 --> 00:40:36,058
Jika mau istri dan anakmu selamat,
lakukan perintahku.

715
00:40:36,142 --> 00:40:37,768
Jika tidak, mereka akan mati.

716
00:40:37,852 --> 00:40:39,979
- Hei… Sial. Hei!
- Sampai nanti.

717
00:40:41,021 --> 00:40:43,149
Sialan.

718
00:40:43,983 --> 00:40:44,859
Hei.

719
00:40:44,942 --> 00:40:48,654
Kalau dia berani menyentuh anakku,
kalian berdua akan kuhabisi.

720
00:40:48,737 --> 00:40:49,572
Kau paham?

721
00:41:02,126 --> 00:41:06,130
Tujuan utamaku menyingkirkan Ma Do-jun
dan membangun bisnis lagi.

722
00:41:06,213 --> 00:41:09,175
Tapi di tengah jalan,
detektif narkoba itu ikut campur.

723
00:41:10,551 --> 00:41:12,553
- Bos.
- Kenapa?

724
00:41:13,137 --> 00:41:16,307
Aku tak paham rumus narkoba di tengah ini.

725
00:41:16,932 --> 00:41:18,350
Ini bahasa Inggris.

726
00:41:18,434 --> 00:41:19,268
Man-gi.

727
00:41:20,936 --> 00:41:22,813
Gambar saja. Paham?

728
00:41:23,314 --> 00:41:24,690
Gambar saja.

729
00:41:24,773 --> 00:41:25,900
Baik, Bos.

730
00:41:28,986 --> 00:41:30,154
Justru ini bagus.

731
00:41:30,738 --> 00:41:32,823
Ma Do-jun dan detektif itu

732
00:41:33,324 --> 00:41:35,701
memang berencana kuhabisi.

733
00:41:36,327 --> 00:41:37,495
Bos.

734
00:41:38,287 --> 00:41:40,039
- Sudah beres.
- Begitu?

735
00:41:46,128 --> 00:41:47,880
Kerja bagus, Man-gi.

736
00:41:49,006 --> 00:41:51,509
Difoto saja dengan kamera.

737
00:41:53,844 --> 00:41:56,430
{\an8}Oh, kamera.

738
00:41:58,557 --> 00:42:01,018
Bos, mobil klinik hewannya ketemu.

739
00:42:05,189 --> 00:42:07,733
Hei, kalian sudah kerja keras.
Aku detektif kasus ini.

740
00:42:07,816 --> 00:42:09,235
Siap, Pak!

741
00:42:10,152 --> 00:42:11,320
Ada keperluan apa?

742
00:42:11,403 --> 00:42:13,239
Apakah kalian sudah makan?

743
00:42:13,322 --> 00:42:15,574
Kami sudah pesan. Sebentar lagi sampai.

744
00:42:15,658 --> 00:42:17,910
Itu tak mengenyangkan.

745
00:42:17,993 --> 00:42:20,412
Makanlah <i>samgyetang </i>dengan ini.

746
00:42:20,496 --> 00:42:22,748
Ada yang perlu kucek sebentar di sini.

747
00:42:22,831 --> 00:42:24,333
- Ambillah.
- Ya?

748
00:42:25,042 --> 00:42:25,960
Tidak.

749
00:42:26,835 --> 00:42:28,504
Makanlah <i>samgyetang </i>mahal.

750
00:42:28,587 --> 00:42:30,464
Tahu, 'kan? Yang pakai tiram.

751
00:42:32,007 --> 00:42:33,133
Terima kasih, Pak!

752
00:42:33,217 --> 00:42:34,927
- Ayo.
- Makan yang banyak.

753
00:42:37,388 --> 00:42:38,597
Tunggu sebentar.

754
00:42:45,521 --> 00:42:46,355
Kenapa?

755
00:42:48,232 --> 00:42:49,775
Boleh kami makan <i>malatang</i>?

756
00:42:50,818 --> 00:42:51,819
Astaga.

757
00:42:51,902 --> 00:42:53,737
Makan apa pun yang kalian mau.

758
00:42:53,821 --> 00:42:55,614
- Terima kasih, Pak!
- Ya.

759
00:42:59,201 --> 00:43:01,495
Hei, kemarilah.

760
00:43:08,460 --> 00:43:10,087
Satu, dua, tiga.

761
00:43:12,506 --> 00:43:13,507
Sudah terbuka.

762
00:43:14,008 --> 00:43:14,883
Tutuplah.

763
00:43:15,384 --> 00:43:18,178
Hei, Ma Do-jun. Kau tak bantu? Sial…

764
00:43:21,974 --> 00:43:24,226
Semua sudah diambil polisi.
Tak ada yang tersisa.

765
00:43:24,310 --> 00:43:26,729
Kau yakin semua sudah diambil?

766
00:43:28,522 --> 00:43:29,940
Nabi kami ada di sini.

767
00:43:41,118 --> 00:43:43,579
<i>- Kupu-kupu</i>
- Apa?

768
00:43:43,662 --> 00:43:45,456
<i>- Kupu-kupu</i>
- Dia sedang apa?

769
00:43:45,539 --> 00:43:48,667
<i>- Datanglah kemari</i>
- Hei, itu mengerikan.

770
00:43:48,751 --> 00:43:52,963
- Berhenti. Itu mengerikan.
<i>- Kupu-kupu kuning, kupu-kupu putih</i>

771
00:43:53,047 --> 00:43:55,841
<i>- Datanglah menari</i>
- Apa akan muncul sesuatu?

772
00:43:55,924 --> 00:43:56,800
Ada apa…

773
00:43:56,884 --> 00:44:01,555
<i>Dalam semilir angin musim semi</i>
<i>Kelopak bunga tersenyum cerah</i>

774
00:44:01,639 --> 00:44:03,974
<i>- Polisi Bangsat terus bercuit</i>
- Kurang ajar.

775
00:44:04,058 --> 00:44:06,352
<i>Menyanyi dan menari</i>

776
00:44:10,814 --> 00:44:12,858
Baiklah, mari kita lihat.

777
00:44:12,941 --> 00:44:13,776
Apa-apaan itu?

778
00:44:19,740 --> 00:44:21,116
Menakjubkan.

779
00:44:23,619 --> 00:44:24,662
Inilah Nabi kami.

780
00:44:24,745 --> 00:44:27,873
Program kecerdasan, Nabi.
GPU, unit pemroses grafik.

781
00:44:27,956 --> 00:44:29,041
Pernah dengar, 'kan?

782
00:44:32,544 --> 00:44:33,796
- Lupakan saja.
- Hei.

783
00:44:34,755 --> 00:44:35,631
Berikan.

784
00:44:39,009 --> 00:44:40,969
Jangan bertindak konyol. Berikan.

785
00:44:44,598 --> 00:44:46,767
Jika sampai mempertaruhkan nyawamu,

786
00:44:47,267 --> 00:44:48,769
artinya ini sangat mahal.

787
00:44:49,269 --> 00:44:52,398
Jika dinilai dengan uang,
sekitar seratus miliar?

788
00:44:52,481 --> 00:44:53,607
Seratus miliar?

789
00:44:55,901 --> 00:44:57,069
Kau dengar, Bos?

790
00:44:58,112 --> 00:44:59,071
Aku dengar.

791
00:44:59,905 --> 00:45:02,074
Ternyata ucapanmu benar, Bos.

792
00:45:02,157 --> 00:45:04,326
Jadi, itu yang ada di sana.

793
00:45:37,901 --> 00:45:39,820
- Astaga.
- Mereka siapa?

794
00:45:39,903 --> 00:45:41,363
Mereka terus membuntuti.

795
00:45:41,447 --> 00:45:42,281
Siapa?

796
00:45:42,364 --> 00:45:43,741
Di sana. Orang itu.

797
00:45:45,200 --> 00:45:46,869
Itu Pak Kim Yeong-gwang.

798
00:45:47,953 --> 00:45:49,830
Apa? Benar, itu Ddong-gang.

799
00:45:49,913 --> 00:45:51,331
Ddong-gang itu siapa?

800
00:45:51,415 --> 00:45:53,125
- Bandar yang kutangkap.
- Apa?

801
00:45:53,208 --> 00:45:55,711
Saat ditangkap,
dia sembunyi di tangki septik.

802
00:45:55,794 --> 00:45:57,212
Jadi, kupanggil Ddong-gang.

803
00:45:57,963 --> 00:45:59,965
Kenapa dia membuntuti kita?

804
00:46:00,632 --> 00:46:02,926
- Ya, dia yang menabrak kita.
- Apa?

805
00:46:03,010 --> 00:46:05,846
Dia mengajakku kerja sama, tapi kutolak.

806
00:46:05,929 --> 00:46:07,556
Dia malah mau membunuhku.

807
00:46:07,639 --> 00:46:09,516
- Dia orang sinting.
- Sial.

808
00:46:09,600 --> 00:46:10,893
Hei, Dokter Anjing.

809
00:46:11,560 --> 00:46:13,061
- Belok.
- Sekarang?

810
00:46:14,271 --> 00:46:15,564
Sekarang.

811
00:46:20,068 --> 00:46:21,361
Hei, ikuti mereka!

812
00:46:32,998 --> 00:46:34,208
Tancap gasnya.

813
00:46:36,752 --> 00:46:39,546
Dokter Anjing, mana semangat
olahraga ekstremmu?

814
00:46:39,630 --> 00:46:41,507
Mana teknik mengepotmu itu?

815
00:46:42,216 --> 00:46:43,050
Apa?

816
00:46:59,566 --> 00:47:01,360
- Jago sekali.
- Benar.

817
00:47:01,860 --> 00:47:03,403
Hei, lihat ke depan!

818
00:47:07,157 --> 00:47:08,200
Maaf, Bos!

819
00:47:09,243 --> 00:47:10,494
Gila!

820
00:47:10,577 --> 00:47:12,079
Hei, cepat putar balik!

821
00:47:12,162 --> 00:47:13,455
- Putar balik!
- Mundur!

822
00:47:17,417 --> 00:47:19,878
Kali ini, aku akan tunjukkan kemampuanku.

823
00:47:20,379 --> 00:47:21,505
Ambil setir di bawah.

824
00:47:22,089 --> 00:47:22,923
Itu setirnya.

825
00:47:23,006 --> 00:47:24,258
Tidak, ada satu lagi.

826
00:47:24,341 --> 00:47:25,509
Ada lagi?

827
00:47:30,931 --> 00:47:31,890
Bisa dicabut?

828
00:47:37,354 --> 00:47:38,522
Mari kita mulai.

829
00:47:40,607 --> 00:47:41,567
Mengepot level satu.

830
00:48:01,378 --> 00:48:04,006
Bukankah seharusnya kau belok kiri?

831
00:48:04,089 --> 00:48:06,174
Tidak apa-apa. Tenanglah, Rambo.

832
00:48:06,675 --> 00:48:08,093
- Tunjukkan.
- Tunjukkan.

833
00:48:08,176 --> 00:48:09,970
- Tunjukkan.
- Tunjukkan kebengisanmu.

834
00:48:10,053 --> 00:48:12,472
- Tunjukkan!
- Ayo tunjukkan!

835
00:48:17,519 --> 00:48:18,478
Kau sedang apa?

836
00:48:18,979 --> 00:48:19,813
Kuklakson.

837
00:48:21,857 --> 00:48:23,150
Aduh, silau.

838
00:48:25,152 --> 00:48:25,986
Kau kenapa?

839
00:48:26,069 --> 00:48:28,697
Tunjukkan kebengisanmu!

840
00:48:29,197 --> 00:48:30,532
- Jangan mengklakson!
- Cepat.

841
00:48:30,616 --> 00:48:33,368
Kubilang, tunjukkan kebengisanmu!

842
00:48:36,663 --> 00:48:37,998
Tancap gas!

843
00:48:41,627 --> 00:48:43,128
Bajingan.

844
00:48:44,838 --> 00:48:46,048
Tancap gas, Rambo.

845
00:48:46,131 --> 00:48:48,133
- Gas terus, Rambo.
- Rambo.

846
00:48:54,681 --> 00:48:58,810
- Jangan! Hei!
- Hati-hati.

847
00:49:06,318 --> 00:49:08,862
- Ada dinding.
- Dinding!

848
00:49:10,030 --> 00:49:11,031
Bisa menabrak!

849
00:49:11,114 --> 00:49:11,990
Menabrak!

850
00:49:12,074 --> 00:49:13,367
Rambo!

851
00:49:15,744 --> 00:49:17,287
Ada dinding!

852
00:49:21,625 --> 00:49:22,459
Dinding!

853
00:49:29,466 --> 00:49:31,051
Kukira akan menabrak.

854
00:49:33,011 --> 00:49:34,763
Tenanglah. Percaya kepadaku.

855
00:49:35,263 --> 00:49:36,306
Kita jalan lagi.

856
00:49:37,724 --> 00:49:39,267
Mereka pergi. Cepat!

857
00:49:39,351 --> 00:49:41,520
Cepat putar balik, Bajingan!

858
00:49:41,603 --> 00:49:42,688
Ayo mundur!

859
00:49:48,944 --> 00:49:50,070
Lebih cepat!

860
00:49:50,153 --> 00:49:52,990
Lebih cepat lagi!

861
00:49:53,073 --> 00:49:56,284
Awas ada kucing. Tidak!

862
00:49:56,368 --> 00:49:58,620
- Sial. Bagaimana ini?
- Hei!

863
00:49:58,704 --> 00:50:00,622
Tidak. Ia imut sekali!

864
00:50:00,706 --> 00:50:02,207
Imut sekali!

865
00:50:24,813 --> 00:50:26,440
Apa? Kita berhasil?

866
00:50:26,523 --> 00:50:28,150
- Tadi naik dinding?
- Hei!

867
00:50:28,233 --> 00:50:31,069
Kalau ini mobil manual,
tekniknya lebih sempurna.

868
00:50:31,653 --> 00:50:32,904
Sekarang,

869
00:50:32,988 --> 00:50:34,990
kita lanjut ke level dua.

870
00:50:40,829 --> 00:50:41,788
Bagus!

871
00:50:50,338 --> 00:50:51,715
Ada dinding!

872
00:50:58,513 --> 00:51:00,724
Dasar dokter sialan.

873
00:51:00,807 --> 00:51:02,100
Kau baik-baik saja?

874
00:51:02,184 --> 00:51:04,478
Tunggu. Apa yang terjadi?

875
00:51:04,561 --> 00:51:05,854
Sial, setirnya ini.…

876
00:51:11,902 --> 00:51:12,903
Kau tak apa?

877
00:51:15,322 --> 00:51:16,823
- Hei!
- Sial.

878
00:51:17,574 --> 00:51:18,408
Ma Do-jun!

879
00:51:19,910 --> 00:51:21,036
Berhenti, Bajingan!

880
00:51:22,037 --> 00:51:23,914
- Hei, tangkap dia!
- Tangkap!

881
00:51:23,997 --> 00:51:24,873
Tangkap!

882
00:51:26,166 --> 00:51:27,209
Berhenti, Bajingan!

883
00:51:30,087 --> 00:51:31,505
Berhenti kau, Bajingan!

884
00:51:35,550 --> 00:51:37,302
Apa-apaan dia? Hei!

885
00:51:49,606 --> 00:51:50,524
Itu orangnya!

886
00:51:52,067 --> 00:51:53,443
Tertangkap kau.

887
00:51:53,527 --> 00:51:55,779
Siapa kau, Bajingan? Hei!

888
00:51:56,780 --> 00:51:58,281
Hei, kita berpencar!

889
00:51:58,365 --> 00:51:59,449
Ayo berpencar!

890
00:52:28,895 --> 00:52:29,729
Dasar keparat.

891
00:52:38,238 --> 00:52:39,614
Kau lihat bajingan itu?

892
00:52:39,698 --> 00:52:41,199
Kau yang mengejarnya duluan.

893
00:52:42,284 --> 00:52:43,702
- Dia ke mana?
- Ke sini…

894
00:52:49,875 --> 00:52:51,001
Astaga.

895
00:52:51,084 --> 00:52:53,253
Ma Do-jun!

896
00:52:54,045 --> 00:52:55,338
Berhenti kabur.

897
00:52:57,007 --> 00:52:58,884
Ada yang menembak, 'kan?

898
00:53:00,635 --> 00:53:01,761
Ikuti aku.

899
00:53:08,768 --> 00:53:09,811
Sialan.

900
00:53:10,770 --> 00:53:11,730
Ma Do-jun.

901
00:53:11,813 --> 00:53:13,481
Astaga, Kim Yeong-gwang.

902
00:53:13,565 --> 00:53:14,482
Kim Yong-gang!

903
00:53:14,566 --> 00:53:16,151
Ya, Kim Yong-gang.

904
00:53:16,234 --> 00:53:17,235
Bangsat kau.

905
00:53:17,319 --> 00:53:18,361
Pak Yong-gang.

906
00:53:18,945 --> 00:53:21,114
Barang ini benar-benar mahal.

907
00:53:21,198 --> 00:53:24,201
Meski kau ingin membelinya,
tidak akan bisa.

908
00:53:24,784 --> 00:53:26,828
Ini kuberikan untukmu. Gratis.

909
00:53:28,371 --> 00:53:29,831
- Hei.
- Apa?

910
00:53:30,415 --> 00:53:31,291
Tak tahu aku?

911
00:53:32,083 --> 00:53:34,127
- Apa?
- Sungguh tak tahu aku?

912
00:53:34,211 --> 00:53:36,713
Ya ampun, tentu saja aku tahu.

913
00:53:36,796 --> 00:53:38,798
Kau Yong-gang dari Incheon. Tentu tahu.

914
00:53:39,674 --> 00:53:42,594
- Tapi kenapa kau pura-pura tak tahu?
- PDB?

915
00:53:42,677 --> 00:53:43,762
Apa itu PDB?

916
00:53:43,845 --> 00:53:45,680
Itu singkatan yang sedang trendi.

917
00:53:45,764 --> 00:53:47,349
Percaya diri berlebihan…

918
00:53:47,432 --> 00:53:48,350
Sialan!

919
00:53:52,520 --> 00:53:53,521
Sialan.

920
00:53:56,942 --> 00:53:59,194
Aku adalah Kim Yong-gang dari Incheon.

921
00:53:59,945 --> 00:54:01,321
Dasar PDB.

922
00:54:06,451 --> 00:54:07,577
Darah?

923
00:54:11,206 --> 00:54:13,124
Itu Ma Do-jun. Benar, 'kan?

924
00:54:13,917 --> 00:54:15,585
Benar, itu dia.

925
00:54:21,049 --> 00:54:22,634
Hei, apa sudah cukup?

926
00:54:23,385 --> 00:54:24,761
Belum. Sedikit lagi!

927
00:54:26,763 --> 00:54:27,597
Sudah sampai?

928
00:54:27,681 --> 00:54:29,182
Sudah!

929
00:54:29,724 --> 00:54:31,101
Hei, Ma Do-jun.

930
00:54:31,184 --> 00:54:32,936
Ma Do-jun, sadarlah…

931
00:54:33,019 --> 00:54:33,937
Masih hidup?

932
00:54:34,020 --> 00:54:34,938
Bagaimana ini?

933
00:54:36,439 --> 00:54:37,399
Apa dia masih hidup?

934
00:54:43,738 --> 00:54:45,699
Ya, syukurlah masih hidup!

935
00:54:45,782 --> 00:54:48,535
Oke. Barangnya jangan sampai rusak.

936
00:54:49,035 --> 00:54:50,829
Dia harus selamat. Paham?

937
00:54:53,915 --> 00:54:55,166
Sekarang, tarik talinya!

938
00:55:05,385 --> 00:55:07,762
Ma Do-jun, kau harus tetap sadar. Oke?

939
00:55:07,846 --> 00:55:09,514
Aku akan tetap sadar…

940
00:55:10,890 --> 00:55:12,392
Kau harus selamat!

941
00:55:12,475 --> 00:55:13,768
Ya, aku akan selamat.

942
00:55:17,188 --> 00:55:18,231
Ada apa?

943
00:55:20,692 --> 00:55:21,818
Ma Do-jun, sadarlah.

944
00:55:24,029 --> 00:55:25,447
Kenapa ini?

945
00:55:25,530 --> 00:55:26,990
Kenapa menyangkut terus?

946
00:55:27,824 --> 00:55:29,075
Hei, sadarlah!

947
