1182
01:08:55,297 --> 01:08:58,175
Hei, Dokter Anjing.
Berhenti sampai di sini.

1183
01:08:58,259 --> 01:08:59,426
Jangan ikut lagi.

1184
01:09:02,304 --> 01:09:04,056
Apa maksud perkataanmu?

1185
01:09:05,307 --> 01:09:07,101
Tak mau. Aku tak akan berhenti.

1186
01:09:07,184 --> 01:09:08,894
Yong-gang mengincarku dan Ma Do-jun.

1187
01:09:08,978 --> 01:09:11,772
Kau harus bersyukur
dia tak tahu tentangmu.

1188
01:09:12,273 --> 01:09:13,107
Sudah cukup.

1189
01:09:13,190 --> 01:09:15,359
Ayo bersatu
menyelamatkan Si-nae dan Yeon-ju.

1190
01:09:15,442 --> 01:09:16,485
Sudah sejauh ini!

1191
01:09:16,569 --> 01:09:17,987
Satu kesalahan, semua tamat!

1192
01:09:19,488 --> 01:09:20,739
Usahamu sudah maksimal.

1193
01:09:21,240 --> 01:09:22,449
Sekarang, pulanglah.

1194
01:09:22,533 --> 01:09:23,993
Kau menyuruhku pulang?

1195
01:09:24,076 --> 01:09:25,828
Setidaknya harus ada yang selamat.

1196
01:09:27,371 --> 01:09:28,247
Tidak.

1197
01:09:29,623 --> 01:09:32,418
Kita harus selamat bersama
atau mati bersama.

1198
01:09:32,501 --> 01:09:34,795
Min-seok, kumohon. Usahamu sudah cukup.

1199
01:09:34,879 --> 01:09:36,255
Terima kasih.

1200
01:09:36,797 --> 01:09:38,757
- Terima kasih.
- Ayo lakukan bersama.

1201
01:09:44,555 --> 01:09:46,724
Ayo Pak Dokter.

1202
01:09:47,224 --> 01:09:48,142
Pegangi dia.

1203
01:09:48,934 --> 01:09:50,186
HWANG CHOONG-SIK

1204
01:09:51,145 --> 01:09:52,479
Diam!

1205
01:09:53,647 --> 01:09:54,815
Ini Choong-sik.

1206
01:09:54,899 --> 01:09:56,442
- Ayo cepat.
- Choong-sik…

1207
01:09:58,694 --> 01:10:01,113
<i>Burung Hantu, aku laporkan situasinya.</i>

1208
01:10:01,197 --> 01:10:03,782
Saat ini mantan istri dan anakku diculik.

1209
01:10:04,658 --> 01:10:06,535
Ma Do-jun kukeluarkan demi sandera.

1210
01:10:06,619 --> 01:10:09,330
<i>Lalu Yong-gang ikut campur</i>
<i>dan semuanya runyam.</i>

1211
01:10:09,413 --> 01:10:10,581
Karena itu,

1212
01:10:11,081 --> 01:10:12,708
berikan aku tiga jam.

1213
01:10:13,542 --> 01:10:14,627
Ini akan kubereskan.

1214
01:10:15,461 --> 01:10:16,712
Choong-sik.

1215
01:10:17,796 --> 01:10:19,506
Mau dibereskan seperti apa?

1216
01:10:20,132 --> 01:10:21,467
Jangan begitu.

1217
01:10:21,967 --> 01:10:23,385
Laporkan lokasimu saja.

1218
01:10:23,469 --> 01:10:25,888
Kujadwalkan pesan otomatis tiga jam lagi.

1219
01:10:26,889 --> 01:10:30,351
Jika tak ada kabar dalam tiga jam,
langsung kirim pasukan.

1220
01:10:30,434 --> 01:10:32,770
<i>Lokasinya ada di pesan nanti.</i>

1221
01:10:32,853 --> 01:10:34,563
Laporkan lokasimu sekarang!

1222
01:10:34,647 --> 01:10:37,066
Pak, nyawa mereka dipertaruhkan.

1223
01:10:37,858 --> 01:10:40,152
Kesalahan kecil bisa merusak semuanya.

1224
01:10:40,236 --> 01:10:41,487
Kau menghadapi

1225
01:10:42,821 --> 01:10:44,365
Yong-gang sendirian?

1226
01:10:45,908 --> 01:10:47,910
Ya, aku bisa.

1227
01:10:47,993 --> 01:10:49,536
Itu Yong-gang.

1228
01:10:50,204 --> 01:10:53,249
Yong-gang yang kejam,
yang kita tangkap sepuluh tahun lalu!

1229
01:10:53,332 --> 01:10:54,833
Aku Hwang Choong-sik.

1230
01:10:54,917 --> 01:10:57,419
Aku kecewa, Pak. Kau tak percaya aku?

1231
01:10:58,963 --> 01:11:00,464
Hei, Hwang Choong-sik.

1232
01:11:01,215 --> 01:11:02,508
Kau Hwang Choong-sik!

1233
01:11:03,092 --> 01:11:04,635
Tentu kami percaya!

1234
01:11:06,720 --> 01:11:07,972
Mohon bantuanmu, Pak.

1235
01:11:09,473 --> 01:11:10,599
Kau…

1236
01:11:15,980 --> 01:11:17,773
{\an8}- Detektif Woo.
- Siap, Pak.

1237
01:11:17,856 --> 01:11:19,692
{\an8}- Dan Detektif Park.
- Siap.

1238
01:11:20,693 --> 01:11:22,403
{\an8}Entah orang lain bagaimana,

1239
01:11:22,987 --> 01:11:24,822
{\an8}tapi kita bisa memercayai Choong-sik.

1240
01:11:25,948 --> 01:11:27,533
{\an8}Wajahnya memang keren…

1241
01:11:27,616 --> 01:11:29,326
- Ya?
- Apa?

1242
01:11:29,910 --> 01:11:31,912
{\an8}…tapi dia berhati lembut.

1243
01:11:32,413 --> 01:11:33,831
{\an8}Kita tahu itu.

1244
01:11:35,416 --> 01:11:37,084
{\an8}- Benar?
- Ya, Pak!

1245
01:11:38,585 --> 01:11:40,671
Baiklah. Tiga jam lagi,

1246
01:11:40,754 --> 01:11:43,549
kita lacak lokasinya dan kirim pasukan.

1247
01:11:43,632 --> 01:11:45,050
- Mengerti?
- Siap, Pak!

1248
01:11:45,134 --> 01:11:46,010
Ke posisi!

1249
01:11:46,093 --> 01:11:47,011
Siap!

1250
01:11:48,304 --> 01:11:50,139
Hye-ran, kau mengerti

1251
01:11:50,973 --> 01:11:52,224
perasaan ibu, 'kan?

1252
01:11:52,808 --> 01:11:53,892
Aku mengerti.

1253
01:11:53,976 --> 01:11:57,855
Setiap melihat Yeon-ju,
aku membayangkan betapa senangnya

1254
01:11:57,938 --> 01:11:59,273
punya anak sepertinya.

1255
01:12:00,274 --> 01:12:01,358
Hye-ran.

1256
01:12:01,442 --> 01:12:02,943
Tolong bantu aku.

1257
01:12:08,574 --> 01:12:10,242
Permisi!

1258
01:12:12,619 --> 01:12:16,623
Perutku sakit. Bolehkan aku ke toilet?

1259
01:12:16,707 --> 01:12:17,916
Sudah mendesak.

1260
01:12:18,000 --> 01:12:19,418
Aku juga lapar!

1261
01:12:20,669 --> 01:12:23,630
Bukan lapar, tapi perutku sakit.

1262
01:12:23,714 --> 01:12:26,050
Aku sudah tak tahan. Tolong kemari.

1263
01:12:31,930 --> 01:12:32,890
- Apa?
- Kemarilah.

1264
01:12:32,973 --> 01:12:35,142
- Kenapa?
- Tolong lepaskan sebentar.

1265
01:12:35,225 --> 01:12:37,353
- Lepaskan ini. Perutku sakit.
- Apa?

1266
01:12:37,436 --> 01:12:39,355
- Mau apa?
- Mustahil buang air di sini.

1267
01:12:39,438 --> 01:12:40,481
Di sini saja.

1268
01:12:40,564 --> 01:12:43,692
- Mana bisa begitu?
- Kenapa tanya aku? Tak tahu!

1269
01:12:43,776 --> 01:12:44,860
Tetap di sini!

1270
01:12:44,943 --> 01:12:46,195
Sedikit lagi…

1271
01:12:47,821 --> 01:12:48,781
Kau sedang apa?

1272
01:12:50,074 --> 01:12:51,241
Ibu!

1273
01:12:51,325 --> 01:12:53,202
- Ibu!
- Cepat kabur!

1274
01:12:53,285 --> 01:12:55,496
- Kaburlah!
- Yeon-ju, cepat lari!

1275
01:12:56,413 --> 01:12:58,707
Tak ada waktu, Yeon-ju. Cepat!

1276
01:12:58,791 --> 01:13:01,210
- Lepaskan aku!
- Diamlah!

1277
01:13:01,293 --> 01:13:02,836
- Keluar!
- Cepat lari!

1278
01:13:02,920 --> 01:13:03,921
- Kemari!
- Cepat!

1279
01:13:04,463 --> 01:13:06,131
Diam kau!

1280
01:13:19,978 --> 01:13:21,480
- Yeon-ju?
- Kau siapa?

1281
01:13:22,106 --> 01:13:22,940
Panggil Tante.

1282
01:13:23,023 --> 01:13:23,982
Tante?

1283
01:13:24,066 --> 01:13:25,025
Oh, bukan.

1284
01:13:26,026 --> 01:13:27,152
Calon Ibu Baru.

1285
01:13:27,861 --> 01:13:29,238
Calon Ibu Baru?

1286
01:13:29,822 --> 01:13:31,198
Kau tak terluka?

1287
01:13:31,281 --> 01:13:33,242
Tante… Tidak. Calon Ibu Baru.

1288
01:13:33,325 --> 01:13:34,910
Tolong bantu ibuku.

1289
01:13:34,993 --> 01:13:36,120
Ibuku dikurung.

1290
01:13:36,203 --> 01:13:37,329
Serius? Di mana?

1291
01:13:37,413 --> 01:13:38,330
Di gudang itu.

1292
01:13:38,414 --> 01:13:39,790
Yeon-ju!

1293
01:13:40,541 --> 01:13:41,875
Anak baik.

1294
01:13:42,501 --> 01:13:43,627
Kau di mana?

1295
01:13:46,505 --> 01:13:47,798
Oke, ikuti aku.

1296
01:13:51,093 --> 01:13:52,469
Hati-hati.

1297
01:13:54,221 --> 01:13:55,305
Tunggu di sini.

1298
01:13:55,389 --> 01:13:58,642
Setelah lihat keberadaan ibumu,
aku akan kembali. Oke?

1299
01:13:59,852 --> 01:14:03,647
Pastikan kau menyelamatkan ibuku,
Tante Calon Ibu Baru.

1300
01:14:03,730 --> 01:14:04,982
Jangan khawatir.

1301
01:14:05,065 --> 01:14:06,567
Tante jago berkelahi.

1302
01:14:10,612 --> 01:14:11,905
Yeon-ju!

1303
01:14:12,614 --> 01:14:13,907
Kau di mana?

1304
01:14:14,950 --> 01:14:15,909
Anak baik.

1305
01:14:17,119 --> 01:14:19,580
Yeon-ju, ayo main dengan Paman!

1306
01:14:26,795 --> 01:14:27,629
Hei, Bajingan!

1307
01:14:40,601 --> 01:14:42,478
Hei, Bajingan Bangsat!

1308
01:14:50,736 --> 01:14:51,778
Kau orangnya?

1309
01:14:52,905 --> 01:14:54,072
Ya, itu aku.

1310
01:14:54,573 --> 01:14:56,575
Dasar bajingan jelek berotak babi!

1311
01:14:56,658 --> 01:14:58,035
Kemari kau.

1312
01:14:59,036 --> 01:15:00,829
Aku jadi ingin makan kaki babi.

1313
01:15:01,455 --> 01:15:02,289
Maju kau.

1314
01:15:03,373 --> 01:15:06,335
Sialan. Jalang ini cari mati!

1315
01:15:06,418 --> 01:15:07,753
Maju, Bajingan!

1316
01:15:14,092 --> 01:15:15,385
Yang benar saja.

1317
01:15:19,640 --> 01:15:20,641
Apa ini?

1318
01:15:21,141 --> 01:15:22,309
Jam tangannya menyala.

1319
01:15:24,102 --> 01:15:25,812
GUDANG 8
LOKASI YEON-JU

1320
01:15:27,314 --> 01:15:29,816
Tunggu. Ternyata bukan Gudang 3.

1321
01:15:33,362 --> 01:15:34,196
Ini jebakan.

1322
01:15:34,279 --> 01:15:35,447
GUDANG 3

1323
01:15:38,075 --> 01:15:39,243
Apa rencanamu?

1324
01:15:40,160 --> 01:15:43,080
- Kuurus dua di kanan. Kau dua di kiri.
- Oke.

1325
01:15:43,163 --> 01:15:44,206
Bisa, 'kan?

1326
01:15:45,207 --> 01:15:46,416
- Dua itu.
- Biar kuurus.

1327
01:15:57,928 --> 01:15:59,346
- Kenapa kau di sini?
- Dasar.

1328
01:16:00,180 --> 01:16:02,474
Gudang 3 itu jebakan.

1329
01:16:02,558 --> 01:16:03,600
Apa?

1330
01:16:04,226 --> 01:16:07,396
Lihat ini.
Jam tangan Yeon-ju menyala lagi.

1331
01:16:07,479 --> 01:16:09,940
Bajingan itu tak bisa kubiarkan…

1332
01:16:26,498 --> 01:16:27,958
GUDANG 8

1333
01:16:28,083 --> 01:16:30,210
Akan kubunuh Kim Yeong-gwang itu.

1334
01:16:30,294 --> 01:16:31,336
Hei, Ma Do-jun.

1335
01:16:31,878 --> 01:16:33,130
Kuingatkan sekali lagi.

1336
01:16:33,213 --> 01:16:35,215
Apa yang terpenting
dalam kasus penculikan?

1337
01:16:35,966 --> 01:16:37,342
Keselamatan sandera.

1338
01:16:37,426 --> 01:16:38,552
Oke.

1339
01:16:38,635 --> 01:16:40,095
Bukan keselamatan sandera,

1340
01:16:40,596 --> 01:16:42,180
tapi keselamatan keluarga kita.

1341
01:17:11,335 --> 01:17:12,210
- Yeon-ju!
- Si-nae!

1342
01:17:12,294 --> 01:17:13,295
Sayang!

1343
01:17:18,467 --> 01:17:19,426
Apa-apaan?

1344
01:17:35,484 --> 01:17:36,443
Senang berjumpa.

1345
01:17:43,742 --> 01:17:44,993
Dinginnya.

1346
01:17:45,494 --> 01:17:47,829
Lama tak berjumpa, Detektif Hwang.

1347
01:17:50,290 --> 01:17:51,458
Ddong-gang sialan.

1348
01:17:52,209 --> 01:17:54,753
Si-nae dan Yeon-ju ada di mana?

1349
01:17:54,836 --> 01:17:55,837
Di mana mereka?

1350
01:17:55,921 --> 01:17:57,381
Kau diam saja.

1351
01:17:58,674 --> 01:18:03,011
Detektif Hwang,
kau masih sama seperti dulu.

1352
01:18:03,095 --> 01:18:04,012
Tak berubah.

1353
01:18:04,096 --> 01:18:07,933
Wajahmu masih membuatku ingin muntah
hanya dengan melihatnya.

1354
01:18:10,519 --> 01:18:11,770
Yong-gang.

1355
01:18:12,312 --> 01:18:13,730
Tak seharusnya kau begini.

1356
01:18:14,606 --> 01:18:16,692
Aku pernah kirim makanan ke penjara.

1357
01:18:17,484 --> 01:18:18,318
Makanan?

1358
01:18:18,819 --> 01:18:19,653
Makanan apa?

1359
01:18:20,487 --> 01:18:24,074
Itu cuma makanan 3.000 won.
Kausebut itu makanan?

1360
01:18:24,950 --> 01:18:25,784
Kau mengejekku?

1361
01:18:28,954 --> 01:18:30,455
Saat di dalam penjara,

1362
01:18:31,039 --> 01:18:33,333
aku terus memikirkan cara membunuhmu

1363
01:18:33,417 --> 01:18:35,085
jika kau berhasil kutangkap.

1364
01:18:35,794 --> 01:18:38,380
Lalu suatu hari di musim dingin,

1365
01:18:38,880 --> 01:18:40,257
aku terpikirkan itu.

1366
01:18:41,508 --> 01:18:43,969
"Benar! Dia akan kubuat mati membeku."

1367
01:18:45,887 --> 01:18:46,722
Man-gi!

1368
01:18:50,434 --> 01:18:51,393
Apa-apaan?

1369
01:18:51,476 --> 01:18:52,811
Mati perlahan-lahan.

1370
01:18:53,770 --> 01:18:55,063
Apa?

1371
01:19:00,235 --> 01:19:01,486
Benar.

1372
01:19:02,362 --> 01:19:04,406
Kau bisa mati membeku.

1373
01:19:05,115 --> 01:19:06,283
Namun,

1374
01:19:06,950 --> 01:19:08,410
rasanya itu belum cukup.

1375
01:19:09,161 --> 01:19:12,330
Setiap aku merasa sesak
di penjara sempit itu,

1376
01:19:12,414 --> 01:19:14,916
aku memikirkan cara agar kau merasakan

1377
01:19:15,000 --> 01:19:17,043
betapa sesaknya aku di sana!

1378
01:19:18,003 --> 01:19:19,045
"Oh, benar!

1379
01:19:19,129 --> 01:19:21,882
Aku bisa membungkus kepalanya
dengan plastik!"

1380
01:19:23,967 --> 01:19:24,843
Hei, Yong-gang.

1381
01:19:24,926 --> 01:19:26,261
- Tunggu.
- Tunggu. Hei.

1382
01:19:26,344 --> 01:19:27,846
Tunggu sebentar.

1383
01:19:27,929 --> 01:19:28,930
- Bajingan.
- Tunggu!

1384
01:19:29,014 --> 01:19:30,766
- Hei.
- Hei, Bajingan!

1385
01:19:30,849 --> 01:19:33,602
Rasakanlah membeku
dengan kepala terbungkus, Polisi Bangsat.

1386
01:19:33,685 --> 01:19:35,687
Kenapa aku juga?

1387
01:19:35,771 --> 01:19:37,564
Kau bonus tambahan.

1388
01:19:37,647 --> 01:19:39,483
- Hei! Bajingan!
- Ayo pergi.

1389
01:19:39,566 --> 01:19:41,610
- Hei!
- Lepaskan dia, Bangsat!

1390
01:19:42,110 --> 01:19:43,695
- Hei, Ddong-gang!
- Yong-gang!

1391
01:19:43,779 --> 01:19:45,071
Bajingan!

1392
01:19:45,155 --> 01:19:46,156
Kim Yong-gang!

1393
01:19:48,658 --> 01:19:50,035
Hei, Bajingan!

1394
01:19:56,166 --> 01:19:58,210
Oi, Suami Baru. Kau di mana?

1395
01:19:58,794 --> 01:20:00,378
Kenapa mencariku?

1396
01:20:00,462 --> 01:20:01,463
Lepas sepatumu.

1397
01:20:02,088 --> 01:20:03,882
- Lepas sepatumu.
- Sepatuku?

1398
01:20:03,965 --> 01:20:04,966
Lepas sepatumu.

1399
01:20:06,551 --> 01:20:08,845
Oke. Itu ada di mana?

1400
01:20:09,638 --> 01:20:11,431
Oh, maaf.

1401
01:20:11,515 --> 01:20:13,099
Aku tak tahu. Kemari.

1402
01:20:13,683 --> 01:20:14,518
Wajahmu.

1403
01:20:14,601 --> 01:20:16,228
- Wajah?
- Mana wajahmu?

1404
01:20:16,311 --> 01:20:18,063
- Wajahku di sini.
- Wajahmu… Oke.

1405
01:20:18,146 --> 01:20:19,606
- Buka mulutmu.
- Apa ini…

1406
01:20:19,689 --> 01:20:23,026
Bagus, buka mulutmu. Lebih lebar.

1407
01:20:24,694 --> 01:20:25,821
Bagus.

1408
01:20:25,904 --> 01:20:27,989
Gigit kaus kakiku dengan gigimu…

1409
01:20:28,990 --> 01:20:30,575
Aduh, jariku!

1410
01:20:30,659 --> 01:20:31,827
Berandal ini…

1411
01:20:31,910 --> 01:20:33,829
Bagus. Tariklah.

1412
01:20:34,913 --> 01:20:37,791
Sini wajahmu. Buka mulutmu lebih lebar.

1413
01:20:39,334 --> 01:20:41,211
Ayo buka mulutmu. Bagus.

1414
01:20:42,546 --> 01:20:43,672
Bagus.

1415
01:20:43,755 --> 01:20:44,673
Berhasil.

1416
01:20:44,756 --> 01:20:45,715
Satu, dua…

1417
01:20:49,219 --> 01:20:50,929
Sekarang giliranku.

1418
01:20:51,429 --> 01:20:55,600
- Cepat, lakukan kepadaku juga.
- Kau ada di mana? Wajahmu…

1419
01:20:57,727 --> 01:20:58,812
Kenapa?

1420
01:20:59,771 --> 01:21:00,647
Kakimu bau.

1421
01:21:00,730 --> 01:21:02,274
Itu tak penting sekarang.

1422
01:21:02,357 --> 01:21:03,900
Buka mulutmu!

1423
01:21:04,693 --> 01:21:05,694
Kaus kakiku!

1424
01:21:08,738 --> 01:21:10,740
- Oke. Ada di mana?
- Di sini.

1425
01:21:10,824 --> 01:21:12,492
Di sini? Tunggu.

1426
01:21:14,077 --> 01:21:15,328
Di mana? Di sini?

1427
01:21:16,746 --> 01:21:18,582
Bukan, itu lubang hidungku.

1428
01:21:18,665 --> 01:21:20,041
Mulutmu…

1429
01:21:22,419 --> 01:21:24,588
Sudah dapat.

1430
01:21:31,303 --> 01:21:34,264
Lepaskan! Kubilang, cepat lepaskan aku!

1431
01:21:34,347 --> 01:21:36,433
Lepaskan aku!

1432
01:21:36,516 --> 01:21:38,393
Hei, Bajingan!

1433
01:21:38,476 --> 01:21:40,353
- Lepaskan aku!
- Lepaskan!

1434
01:21:40,437 --> 01:21:42,314
- Kalian salah orang.
- Aku tak akan diam!

1435
01:21:42,397 --> 01:21:44,357
Aku wartawan berita kriminal.

1436
01:21:44,441 --> 01:21:47,944
Jika mau berbisnis,
kalian harus punya koneksi dengan media.

1437
01:21:48,028 --> 01:21:49,988
Dunia ini dikendalikan media!

1438
01:21:50,071 --> 01:21:51,323
Tunggu.

1439
01:21:53,617 --> 01:21:54,451
Sudah senior?

1440
01:21:54,534 --> 01:21:56,953
Delapan tahun aku jadi wartawan kriminal.

1441
01:21:57,037 --> 01:21:58,204
Itu baru sebentar.

1442
01:21:58,288 --> 01:21:59,915
Itu tidak sebentar!

1443
01:21:59,998 --> 01:22:03,710
Aku kenal banyak polisi dan jaksa.

1444
01:22:03,793 --> 01:22:06,338
Wah, jaksa.

1445
01:22:06,421 --> 01:22:07,756
Aku kenal Kepala Kejari.

1446
01:22:07,839 --> 01:22:10,342
Wah, Kepala Kejari.

1447
01:22:10,425 --> 01:22:13,303
Aku kenal lebih dari sepuluh
kepala kejaksaan.

1448
01:22:13,386 --> 01:22:15,639
- Itu berguna untuk kalian.
- Persetan!

1449
01:22:16,640 --> 01:22:18,892
Kaukira aku percaya
istri polisi dan wartawan?

1450
01:22:19,392 --> 01:22:21,853
Lebih baik percaya penipu. Mati saja.

1451
01:22:35,742 --> 01:22:36,910
Kenapa?

1452
01:22:36,993 --> 01:22:38,828
Ada apa? Kenapa?

1453
01:22:41,414 --> 01:22:42,999
Kau kenapa?

1454
01:22:46,670 --> 01:22:47,754
Kenapa?

1455
01:22:55,804 --> 01:22:57,681
Itu jatuh!

1456
01:23:10,485 --> 01:23:11,903
Apa-apaan ini?

1457
01:23:14,155 --> 01:23:15,448
Kau sedang apa?

1458
01:23:15,532 --> 01:23:17,450
Kenapa gigit? Sedang apa kau?

1459
01:23:18,326 --> 01:23:20,829
- Apa-apaan?
- Sekarang aku bukan manusia.

1460
01:23:20,912 --> 01:23:22,122
Aku adalah anjing.

1461
01:23:22,205 --> 01:23:24,582
Anjing yang menggigit jika lihat tali!

1462
01:23:26,292 --> 01:23:27,669
Apa-apaan dia?

1463
01:23:27,752 --> 01:23:29,129
Bagus. Gigitlah!

1464
01:23:29,212 --> 01:23:30,213
Ya, di sana.

1465
01:23:35,677 --> 01:23:37,178
Bagus sekali.

1466
01:23:40,348 --> 01:23:42,642
Kenapa kau jago sekali?

1467
01:23:46,688 --> 01:23:47,981
Ayo pergi.

1468
01:23:53,069 --> 01:23:54,404
Bajingan kalian!

1469
01:23:54,487 --> 01:23:56,239
Minggirlah.

1470
01:23:57,240 --> 01:23:58,450
Apa tak ada alat?

1471
01:23:59,743 --> 01:24:01,161
Ada ini.

1472
01:24:01,828 --> 01:24:03,163
Kau tinggi. Ambil ini.

1473
01:24:10,545 --> 01:24:11,755
Kenapa?

1474
01:24:12,255 --> 01:24:14,716
- Tanganku seperti tersetrum.
- Minggir.

1475
01:24:18,178 --> 01:24:20,722
Kusuruh kau hati-hati.
Tunggu, mundur dulu.

1476
01:24:31,775 --> 01:24:33,026
Ini disket

1477
01:24:33,860 --> 01:24:35,236
seharga 100 miliar itu?

1478
01:24:37,030 --> 01:24:38,782
Itu bukan disket,

1479
01:24:40,867 --> 01:24:43,828
tapi program kecerdasan buatan.
Dasar tolol.

1480
01:24:47,499 --> 01:24:48,500
Maaf!

1481
01:24:48,583 --> 01:24:50,919
Saat kau bilang mengambil alih Incheon,

1482
01:24:51,002 --> 01:24:53,296
aku yakin ada dalang lain di balikmu.

1483
01:24:53,379 --> 01:24:54,923
Siapa yang membantumu?

1484
01:24:55,006 --> 01:24:56,466
Itu dia! Nabi!

1485
01:24:56,549 --> 01:24:57,675
Siapa itu Nabi?

1486
01:24:58,301 --> 01:24:59,177
Siapa bajingan itu?

1487
01:24:59,260 --> 01:25:01,429
Sial!

1488
01:25:04,349 --> 01:25:05,934
Jika tertidur, kita mati.

1489
01:25:06,017 --> 01:25:07,143
Aku tahu.

1490
01:25:07,685 --> 01:25:10,146
Tapi, aku sangat kedinginan.

1491
01:25:10,688 --> 01:25:12,232
Kita tak boleh tertidur,

1492
01:25:12,732 --> 01:25:14,275
jadi giliran kau bertanya.

1493
01:25:14,901 --> 01:25:15,860
- Baiklah.
- Ya.

1494
01:25:15,944 --> 01:25:17,320
Aku akan bertanya.

1495
01:25:20,490 --> 01:25:22,283
Burung apa yang kaya?

1496
01:25:24,244 --> 01:25:25,245
Burung hitam?

1497
01:25:25,328 --> 01:25:26,162
Belibis.

1498
01:25:26,746 --> 01:25:28,373
Belibis?

1499
01:25:30,250 --> 01:25:31,417
Tanya lagi.

1500
01:25:31,918 --> 01:25:33,086
Tanya soal hewan.

1501
01:25:34,546 --> 01:25:37,215
Kata apa yang dibenci kelelawar?

1502
01:25:40,593 --> 01:25:41,427
Cahaya?

1503
01:25:42,554 --> 01:25:43,972
"Dasar kampret."

1504
01:25:47,016 --> 01:25:48,184
Kau memakiku?

1505
01:25:49,185 --> 01:25:50,687
Dari semua ayam,

1506
01:25:51,312 --> 01:25:52,939
ayam apa yang paling besar?

1507
01:25:53,648 --> 01:25:54,899
Entahlah, Bajingan.

1508
01:26:00,738 --> 01:26:02,240
Ayam semesta.

1509
01:26:06,870 --> 01:26:09,372
Ayam semesta.

1510
01:26:14,419 --> 01:26:17,005
Astaga, dingin sekali.

1511
01:26:21,926 --> 01:26:24,387
Nabi itu yang sedang kaupegang.

1512
01:26:28,558 --> 01:26:32,061
Program itu
adalah segalanya bagi bisnis kami.

1513
01:26:32,812 --> 01:26:35,982
Itulah inti bisnis kami
dan jantung dari AI.

1514
01:26:38,818 --> 01:26:41,613
Jantung dari AI?

1515
01:26:42,197 --> 01:26:43,573
Singkat saja.

1516
01:26:44,365 --> 01:26:48,203
Satu GPU itu menjalankan
total 312 triliun operasi per detik.

1517
01:26:48,286 --> 01:26:49,662
Tunggu sebentar.

1518
01:26:51,164 --> 01:26:54,042
Totalnya berapa, katamu?

1519
01:26:55,084 --> 01:26:57,587
Totalnya 312 triliun per detik.

1520
01:26:57,670 --> 01:26:59,255
Program AI biasa

1521
01:26:59,339 --> 01:27:02,383
normalnya punya 10.000 GPU bernama A100.

1522
01:27:02,926 --> 01:27:04,260
Jika ada 10.000,

1523
01:27:04,344 --> 01:27:07,305
itu berarti 312 triliun dikali 60 detik,

1524
01:27:07,388 --> 01:27:09,891
dikali 24 jam, dikali 60 menit.

1525
01:27:09,974 --> 01:27:11,517
Tunggu.

1526
01:27:11,601 --> 01:27:13,144
Berapa, katamu?

1527
01:27:13,728 --> 01:27:14,562
- Begini…
- Tolol.

1528
01:27:15,146 --> 01:27:19,943
Jadi, 312 triliun dikali 60 detik,
dikali 24 jam, dikali 60 menit…

1529
01:27:20,026 --> 01:27:22,695
Tunggu! Berhenti mengalikannya.

1530
01:27:26,407 --> 01:27:28,743
Dunia banyak berubah setelah aku bebas.

1531
01:27:28,826 --> 01:27:30,453
Orang-orang bilang,

1532
01:27:30,536 --> 01:27:32,497
"Dunia sudah berubah,

1533
01:27:33,248 --> 01:27:34,624
jadi kau pun harus berubah."

1534
01:27:34,707 --> 01:27:35,583
Tapi kenapa?

1535
01:27:36,084 --> 01:27:37,502
Kenapa aku harus berubah?

1536
01:27:37,585 --> 01:27:39,921
Berbisnis dengan mainan konyol begini…

1537
01:27:48,429 --> 01:27:49,764
Apakah kau menyesal

1538
01:27:50,765 --> 01:27:52,225
telah bercerai?

1539
01:27:54,352 --> 01:27:55,728
Aku tak menyesal.

1540
01:27:56,729 --> 01:27:59,649
Selama Si-nae bahagia,

1541
01:28:00,358 --> 01:28:01,901
itu sudah cukup.

1542
01:28:04,237 --> 01:28:05,321
Meski begitu,

1543
01:28:06,197 --> 01:28:09,867
aku suka kau.

1544
01:28:11,911 --> 01:28:15,331
Aku juga, Kak.

1545
01:28:21,921 --> 01:28:23,548
Kita berdua…

1546
01:28:25,550 --> 01:28:28,261
tak boleh mati seperti ini.

1547
01:28:29,554 --> 01:28:31,306
Tentu saja!

1548
01:28:33,224 --> 01:28:34,809
Karena kita

1549
01:28:36,102 --> 01:28:40,398
punya keluarga!

1550
01:28:41,357 --> 01:28:42,233
Benar.

1551
01:28:47,113 --> 01:28:48,448
Ayo kita coba lagi.

1552
01:28:48,948 --> 01:28:50,533
Sekali lagi.

1553
01:29:01,127 --> 01:29:03,129
Ini bukan cara main Kim Yong-gang.

1554
01:29:05,214 --> 01:29:07,467
Akan kubereskan polisi narkoba itu

1555
01:29:08,176 --> 01:29:10,428
dan Ma Do-jun juga.

1556
01:29:10,511 --> 01:29:12,472
Ini kartu pemungkasku.

1557
01:29:12,555 --> 01:29:14,140
Kartu pemungkas Yong-gang

1558
01:29:15,224 --> 01:29:16,601
yang menuntaskan semuanya.

1559
01:29:17,685 --> 01:29:18,770
Makanya,

1560
01:29:19,520 --> 01:29:21,939
orang yang menyebabkan ini semua terjadi…

1561
01:29:24,359 --> 01:29:25,401
adalah kau, 'kan?

1562
01:29:25,485 --> 01:29:26,903
Jika kau tak ada,

1563
01:29:27,403 --> 01:29:29,614
semuanya akan kembali seperti dulu.

1564
01:29:29,697 --> 01:29:31,491
Jangan sentuh istriku, Bangsat!

1565
01:29:38,331 --> 01:29:39,207
Tadi bergerak?

1566
01:29:39,999 --> 01:29:41,167
Ya, bergerak.

1567
01:29:41,250 --> 01:29:42,085
Bergerak?

1568
01:29:44,837 --> 01:29:46,506
Seharusnya begini sejak tadi!

1569
01:29:49,509 --> 01:29:50,551
Kau bilang

1570
01:29:51,094 --> 01:29:53,388
bahwa aku banyak menonton film?

1571
01:29:53,471 --> 01:29:56,307
Kau bilang aku harus mulai hidup baru?

1572
01:29:57,350 --> 01:29:58,643
Teruslah mengoceh.

1573
01:29:59,560 --> 01:30:00,520
Jangan.

1574
01:30:05,316 --> 01:30:07,735
Jika tidak, kau benar-benar akan mati.

1575
01:30:20,540 --> 01:30:22,667
Begitukah? Aku penasaran.

1576
01:30:23,709 --> 01:30:24,961
Teruslah mengoceh.

1577
01:30:25,962 --> 01:30:28,131
Ayo mengoceh dengan mulut pintarmu itu!

1578
01:30:29,340 --> 01:30:31,050
Kubilang, teruslah mengoceh!

1579
01:31:09,589 --> 01:31:10,923
Sayang.

1580
01:31:14,093 --> 01:31:14,927
Kau tak apa?

1581
01:31:15,011 --> 01:31:16,012
Bos!

1582
01:31:16,637 --> 01:31:18,723
Kenapa diam saja? Bunuh mereka!

1583
01:31:18,806 --> 01:31:20,558
Tangkap mereka!

1584
01:31:22,310 --> 01:31:23,644
Sayang.

1585
01:31:27,857 --> 01:31:29,108
Cepatlah.

1586
01:31:49,086 --> 01:31:49,921
Siapa aku?

1587
01:31:50,505 --> 01:31:52,924
Kim Yeong-gwang.

1588
01:31:53,007 --> 01:31:54,133
Angkat dia.

1589
01:31:57,762 --> 01:32:00,598
- Hei.
- Bajingan kau!

1590
01:32:09,190 --> 01:32:10,024
Sayang.

1591
01:32:11,734 --> 01:32:12,610
Hei!

1592
01:32:13,110 --> 01:32:13,945
Ambil pisau.

1593
01:32:15,780 --> 01:32:16,614
Hye-ran.

1594
01:32:16,697 --> 01:32:18,241
Dasar bajingan.

1595
01:32:18,866 --> 01:32:19,992
Oi, Bangsat.

1596
01:32:20,785 --> 01:32:23,287
Kau tahu? Aku…

1597
01:32:34,257 --> 01:32:35,466
Siapa itu?

1598
01:32:38,719 --> 01:32:39,887
Hei, Ddong-gang!

1599
01:32:40,388 --> 01:32:41,597
Senang bertemu lagi.

1600
01:32:42,390 --> 01:32:43,849
Bajingan keparat!

1601
01:32:44,892 --> 01:32:47,270
Choong-sik! Min-seok!

1602
01:32:47,853 --> 01:32:48,771
Para suami.

1603
01:32:48,854 --> 01:32:52,024
Dokter Anjing, ayo mengepot 135 derajat!

1604
01:32:52,108 --> 01:32:52,942
Oke!

1605
01:32:55,987 --> 01:32:57,863
Bagus!

1606
01:33:00,575 --> 01:33:01,742
Maju kalian, Bajingan!

1607
01:33:10,001 --> 01:33:11,460
Si-nae, mana Yeon-ju?

1608
01:33:11,544 --> 01:33:12,753
Yeon-ju di mana?

1609
01:33:13,337 --> 01:33:16,299
Dia berhasil kabur.
Jo A-ra sudah mengamankannya.

1610
01:33:16,382 --> 01:33:17,592
Choong-sik Gila!

1611
01:33:18,718 --> 01:33:19,719
Bagus!

1612
01:33:20,219 --> 01:33:21,762
Sayapku sudah membentang!

1613
01:33:24,473 --> 01:33:26,684
- Si-nae!
- Min-seok, hati-hati!

1614
01:33:31,230 --> 01:33:32,481
Ma Do-jun, tolong.

1615
01:33:34,191 --> 01:33:36,193
- Ddong-gang!
- Sialan.

1616
01:33:36,694 --> 01:33:39,113
Bos, serahkan kepada kami.

1617
01:33:40,072 --> 01:33:41,574
Bajingan!

1618
01:33:48,247 --> 01:33:50,708
- Si-nae!
- Cepat tangkap dia!

1619
01:33:51,208 --> 01:33:52,460
Hei!

1620
01:33:55,212 --> 01:33:56,505
Sayang, jangan!

1621
01:34:09,310 --> 01:34:12,647
Hwang Choong-sik, kau sungguh memuakkan.

1622
01:34:13,147 --> 01:34:15,650
Aku tak mau lihat lagi
wajahmu yang mirip kera itu.

1623
01:34:15,733 --> 01:34:18,486
Maju kau, Patkai.

1624
01:34:55,523 --> 01:34:56,899
Bajingan keparat!

1625
01:35:02,530 --> 01:35:04,156
Astaga.

1626
01:35:05,616 --> 01:35:07,451
Ma Do-jun, kau baik-baik saja?

1627
01:35:09,704 --> 01:35:10,871
- Satu!
- Dua!

1628
01:35:10,955 --> 01:35:11,789
Tiga!

1629
01:35:15,793 --> 01:35:17,002
Bagaimana ini?

1630
01:35:17,086 --> 01:35:18,337
Si-nae!

1631
01:35:26,512 --> 01:35:28,514
Sayang, kau tak apa-apa?

1632
01:35:29,014 --> 01:35:30,015
Si-nae!

1633
01:35:55,750 --> 01:35:56,959
Bagaimana?

1634
01:35:57,042 --> 01:35:58,669
Seperti naik wahana, 'kan?

1635
01:35:58,753 --> 01:35:59,670
Mengasyikkan?

1636
01:36:00,171 --> 01:36:01,005
Bangunlah.

1637
01:36:01,088 --> 01:36:02,298
Bagus. Ayo bangun.

1638
01:36:02,381 --> 01:36:03,424
Enyah kau!

1639
01:36:03,507 --> 01:36:06,969
Ddong-gang, kemarilah. Mau ke mana?

1640
01:36:07,052 --> 01:36:10,639
Hei, berhenti menempel terus.
Dasar lintah menyebalkan!

1641
01:36:10,723 --> 01:36:12,266
Maaf, Ddong-gang.

1642
01:36:12,349 --> 01:36:13,976
Aku sangat suka denganmu.

1643
01:36:14,059 --> 01:36:14,894
Dasar!

1644
01:36:20,733 --> 01:36:23,027
Ddong-gang. Ayo kita pergi.

1645
01:36:26,614 --> 01:36:28,949
Lepaskan aku, Bajingan!

1646
01:36:29,033 --> 01:36:30,075
Tertangkap kau!

1647
01:36:32,244 --> 01:36:33,162
Tolong!

1648
01:36:35,414 --> 01:36:37,833
- Choong-sik!
- Kak!

1649
01:36:37,917 --> 01:36:39,001
Pegangi dia!

1650
01:36:39,668 --> 01:36:41,754
Serahkan kakinya kepada atlet judo ini!

1651
01:36:43,088 --> 01:36:44,089
Putar!

1652
01:36:47,426 --> 01:36:48,344
Kak, borgolnya!

1653
01:36:50,888 --> 01:36:53,224
Semua sudah selesai, Patkai.

1654
01:36:55,601 --> 01:36:56,977
Kau hebat, Choong-sik Gila!

1655
01:36:57,895 --> 01:36:59,814
- Mana Yeon-ju?
- A-ra?

1656
01:37:00,397 --> 01:37:01,941
Dia bersembunyi di luar.

1657
01:37:02,024 --> 01:37:03,442
Oke, bagus.

1658
01:37:03,943 --> 01:37:05,069
Min-seok.

1659
01:37:08,405 --> 01:37:09,698
Hei, mana Ma Do-jun?

1660
01:37:09,782 --> 01:37:11,826
- Di mana?
- Apa?

1661
01:37:11,909 --> 01:37:12,993
Di mana Ma Do-jun?

1662
01:37:15,830 --> 01:37:16,997
Tunggu sebentar.

1663
01:37:24,463 --> 01:37:25,589
Apa-apaan kalian?

1664
01:37:25,673 --> 01:37:28,968
Itu kapalku! Berhenti!

1665
01:37:35,766 --> 01:37:37,560
- A-ra, di mana?
- Ma Do-jun bajingan.

1666
01:37:37,643 --> 01:37:38,477
Ada di sana.

1667
01:37:40,104 --> 01:37:41,188
Bajingan itu!

1668
01:37:43,190 --> 01:37:44,942
Ma Do-jun!

1669
01:37:45,025 --> 01:37:46,068
Apa? Ma Do-jun?

1670
01:37:46,151 --> 01:37:47,236
Kapal yang mana?

1671
01:37:47,862 --> 01:37:49,071
Kapal itu!

1672
01:37:49,154 --> 01:37:51,574
Yeon-ju ada di kapal itu! Bagaimana ini?

1673
01:37:51,657 --> 01:37:52,616
- Apa?
- Ya?

1674
01:37:52,700 --> 01:37:55,035
Astaga, Choong-sik!
Min-seok, bagaimana ini?

1675
01:37:55,119 --> 01:37:56,078
Yeon-ju!

1676
01:37:56,161 --> 01:37:57,329
Sial!

1677
01:37:57,413 --> 01:37:59,331
Apa yang mau kaulakukan?

1678
01:37:59,415 --> 01:38:01,000
- Tak tahu!
- Astaga.

1679
01:38:01,083 --> 01:38:03,586
Apa pun caranya harus kita selamatkan!

1680
01:38:03,669 --> 01:38:05,546
- Astaga.
- A-ra, bagaimana?

1681
01:38:05,629 --> 01:38:07,673
- Bagaimana ini?
- Astaga.

1682
01:38:08,591 --> 01:38:10,634
- Tunggu sebentar!
- Kenapa?

1683
01:38:15,055 --> 01:38:16,098
Di sana…

1684
01:38:22,479 --> 01:38:23,898
Seharusnya aku berenang saja.

1685
01:38:25,357 --> 01:38:26,275
Kak, kau aman?

1686
01:38:34,617 --> 01:38:37,244
Ini punya Yeon-ju, jadi agak kecil!

1687
01:38:38,829 --> 01:38:41,999
Hei, benar kau profesional, 'kan?

1688
01:38:42,499 --> 01:38:44,209
Kau sering melakukan ini, 'kan?

1689
01:38:45,044 --> 01:38:46,337
Kenapa? Kau takut?

1690
01:38:46,837 --> 01:38:49,673
Tidak. Aku sama sekali tidak takut.

1691
01:38:50,674 --> 01:38:51,675
Kita berangkat.

1692
01:38:52,259 --> 01:38:53,093
Satu.

1693
01:38:53,177 --> 01:38:54,386
Dua.

1694
01:38:54,470 --> 01:38:56,972
Hei! Tunggu sebentar, Berandal.

1695
01:38:57,056 --> 01:38:59,475
Aku harus menyiapkan hati dulu.

1696
01:38:59,558 --> 01:39:01,268
- Kurang ajar.
- Untuk apa?

1697
01:39:01,352 --> 01:39:02,186
Tiga!

1698
01:39:24,208 --> 01:39:25,125
Dia kenapa?

1699
01:39:26,210 --> 01:39:28,087
Kak Choong-sik!

1700
01:39:31,298 --> 01:39:32,883
Ada apa?

1701
01:39:34,009 --> 01:39:36,470
Jangan bergerak. Diamlah!

1702
01:39:37,346 --> 01:39:38,555
Apa-apaan dia?

1703
01:39:40,849 --> 01:39:42,518
Kak!

1704
01:39:43,268 --> 01:39:45,229
Diam. Jangan bergerak.

1705
01:39:45,312 --> 01:39:47,064
Kau tak mau selamatkan Yeon-ju?

1706
01:39:48,190 --> 01:39:49,149
Yeon-ju.

1707
01:39:49,650 --> 01:39:52,403
Kita harus menyelamatkan Yeon-ju.

1708
01:39:52,903 --> 01:39:54,571
Hei, itu dia.

1709
01:39:55,239 --> 01:39:56,490
Merapat ke sana.

1710
01:39:57,199 --> 01:39:58,242
Oke.

1711
01:40:01,036 --> 01:40:02,621
Kita mau ke mana?

1712
01:40:03,163 --> 01:40:05,708
Ke mana pun, asal bersamamu.

1713
01:40:08,627 --> 01:40:11,213
Jangan berisik, Kak. Mereka bisa dengar.

1714
01:40:14,216 --> 01:40:17,136
- Tak ada yang akan mengejar, 'kan?
- Siapa yang bisa mengejar?

1715
01:40:17,219 --> 01:40:18,554
Detektif narkoba itu.

1716
01:40:18,637 --> 01:40:21,682
Mana bisa mengejar di tengah laut?
Mau berenang?

1717
01:40:21,765 --> 01:40:23,475
Atau terbang dengan sayap?

1718
01:40:25,811 --> 01:40:27,271
Astaga! Apa ini?

1719
01:40:27,354 --> 01:40:28,564
Kau siapa?

1720
01:40:28,647 --> 01:40:29,982
Yeon-ju.

1721
01:40:30,065 --> 01:40:31,275
Yeon-ju?

1722
01:40:31,358 --> 01:40:33,485
Siapa Yeon-ju? Kenapa dia di sini?

1723
01:40:33,569 --> 01:40:34,403
Ayah?

1724
01:40:34,486 --> 01:40:35,612
"Ayah"?

1725
01:40:35,696 --> 01:40:38,115
- Ayah!
- Mustahil ayahmu di sini…

1726
01:40:39,366 --> 01:40:40,659
Ayah!

1727
01:40:40,743 --> 01:40:42,286
Yeon-ju!

1728
01:40:42,369 --> 01:40:45,414
Kami datang menyelamatkanmu!

1729
01:40:45,497 --> 01:40:47,082
Bajingan!

1730
01:40:47,166 --> 01:40:49,918
Memuakkan! Kau mengejar sampai ke sini?

1731
01:40:50,002 --> 01:40:51,712
Keadilan pasti menang.

1732
01:40:51,795 --> 01:40:54,006
Penjahat pasti tertangkap.

1733
01:40:54,548 --> 01:40:56,759
Jangan macam-macam dengan suamiku!

1734
01:40:57,384 --> 01:40:59,386
Jangan macam-macam dengan kakakku!

1735
01:40:59,970 --> 01:41:02,306
Jangan macam-macam dengan ayahku!

1736
01:41:04,141 --> 01:41:05,309
Berhenti!

1737
01:41:08,353 --> 01:41:12,524
Peserta berikutnya adalah Hwang Yeon-ju
dari kelas 2-4.

1738
01:41:12,608 --> 01:41:14,777
Dengan tema "Uniknya Keluargaku".

1739
01:41:23,160 --> 01:41:24,369
Yeon-ju.

1740
01:41:24,912 --> 01:41:26,663
- Turunkan tanganmu.
- Astaga, Kak.

1741
01:41:27,915 --> 01:41:31,085
Halo, namaku adalah Yeon-ju.

1742
01:41:31,168 --> 01:41:33,754
Aku punya dua ayah.

1743
01:41:33,837 --> 01:41:37,382
Jadi, kebahagiaanku dua kali lipat.

1744
01:41:39,051 --> 01:41:40,427
Ya, benar.

1745
01:41:41,720 --> 01:41:43,347
Keluarga tak harus serumah, 'kan?

1746
01:41:43,847 --> 01:41:45,099
Tentu saja.

1747
01:41:45,682 --> 01:41:48,227
Bisa tertawa bersama begini juga keluarga.

1748
01:41:52,356 --> 01:41:54,733
Kak, kenapa kentut di sini?

1749
01:41:54,817 --> 01:41:55,859
- Bau.
- Bukan aku.

1750
01:41:55,943 --> 01:41:57,152
- Bukan aku.
- Astaga.

1751
01:41:57,236 --> 01:41:59,780
- Pagi tadi aku sudah buang air.
- Si-nae, cium ini.

1752
01:42:00,405 --> 01:42:01,490
Akan kufoto.

1753
01:42:01,573 --> 01:42:03,033
Tunggu sebentar.

1754
01:42:03,534 --> 01:42:05,327
Ayo berfoto bersama Kak Choong-sik.

1755
01:42:05,410 --> 01:42:08,038
Benar juga. Tapi dia ke mana?

1756
01:42:08,872 --> 01:42:11,917
Padahal tadi ada di samping sini.

1757
01:42:16,880 --> 01:42:19,258
Aku penasaran. Kenapa kalian bercerai?

1758
01:42:19,341 --> 01:42:21,927
- Karena aku menggertakkan gigi.
- Aku juga.

1759
01:42:22,427 --> 01:42:23,470
Apakah berisik?

1760
01:42:23,554 --> 01:42:25,305
Tenang, aku pasang implan.

1761
01:42:26,014 --> 01:42:27,141
Dan kudengar,

1762
01:42:27,641 --> 01:42:29,143
kau punya pesona, Sayang?

1763
01:42:29,226 --> 01:42:30,519
Kata Yeon-ju,

1764
01:42:30,602 --> 01:42:32,938
kau punya senyuman mematikan.

1765
01:42:34,857 --> 01:42:37,401
Jika melihatnya, kau mungkin bisa mati.

1766
01:42:37,484 --> 01:42:38,694
Coba kulihat.

1767
01:42:46,535 --> 01:42:50,289
HUSBANDS IN ACTION

1768
01:42:50,372 --> 01:42:52,291
{\an8}NYONYA BOS

1769
01:43:13,353 --> 01:43:15,272
Kau bilang

1770
01:43:15,772 --> 01:43:17,399
suamiku ada di mana?

1771
01:47:02,082 --> 01:47:07,087
Terjemahan subtitle oleh Maharani Djenial